    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.718e1e63794b0c14e316",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Mute timings and active time intervals](ref:shared-mute-timings) and [silences](ref:shared-silences) are distinct methods to suppress notifications. They do not prevent alert rules from being evaluated or stop alert instances from appearing in the user interface; they only prevent notifications from being created.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure mute timings and active time intervals",
        "Mute timings and active time intervals vs silences"
      ],
