      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. You can [link the alert rule to a panel](ref:link-alert-rules-to-panels). This includes the dashboard and panel URLs via `{{.Alert.DashboardURL}}` and `{{.Alert.PanelURL}}`.",
