      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.598b416c813976d88d34",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud users can request this feature by [opening a support ticket in the Cloud Portal](/profile/org#support).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ea683134fa05bab1c6b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This feature is not supported in Mimir or Loki, or when Grafana is configured to send alerts to other Alertmanagers such as the Prometheus Alertmanager.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4afb1b64616ceecc094b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When an alert is fired or resolved Grafana takes a screenshot of the panel associated with the alert. This is determined via the Dashboard UID and Panel ID annotations of the rule. Grafana cannot take a screenshot for alerts that are not associated with a panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 33,
        "lineEnd": 33,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L33-L33"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d6422fa9a9b90f34973",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana takes at most two screenshots for each alert: once when the alert fires and again when the alert is resolved. Screenshots are not re-taken over the lifetime of the alert, instead you should open the panel in Grafana to follow the data in real time. In addition, depending on how alerts are grouped in your notification policies, Grafana might send a notification with many screenshots of the same panel. This happens because Grafana does not know how your alerts are grouped at the time a screenshot is taken, and so acts conservatively by taking a screenshot for every alert.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 35,
        "lineEnd": 35,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L35-L35"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.74711e5eb2c701444694",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After a screenshot has been taken Grafana can either upload it to a cloud storage service such as Amazon S3, Azure Blob Storage or Google Cloud Storage; upload the screenshot to it's internal web server; or upload it to the service that is receiving the notification, such as Slack. Which option you should choose depends on how your Grafana is managed and which integrations you use. More information on this can be found in Requirements.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 37,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L37-L37"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a126fd48a76db58fe402",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Refer to the table at the end of this page for a list of contact points and their support for images in notifications.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 39,
        "lineEnd": 39,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L39-L39"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f1baf7b10dba5c5838c6",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. To use images in notifications, Grafana OSS and Enterprise must be set up to use the [Grafana image renderer](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/) service.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 43,
        "lineEnd": 43,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L43-L43"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.44c9016622c7c496d2f7",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. When a screenshot is taken, it is saved to the [data][paths] folder, even if Grafana is configured to upload screenshots to a cloud storage service. Grafana must have write-access to this folder otherwise screenshots cannot be saved to disk and an error is logged for each failed screenshot attempt.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 45,
        "lineEnd": 45,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L45-L45"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb6da4f4ae53222f21c4",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "3. You should use a cloud storage service unless sending alerts to Discord, email, Pushover, Slack or Telegram. These integrations support either embedding screenshots in the email or attaching screenshots to the notification, while other integrations must link screenshots uploaded to a cloud storage bucket. If a cloud storage service has been configured then integrations that support both link screenshots from the cloud storage bucket instead of embedding or attaching screenshots to the notification.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 47,
        "lineEnd": 47,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L47-L47"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.855e441a9c0cb3665c48",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "4. If uploading screenshots to a cloud storage service such as Amazon S3, Azure Blob Storage or Google Cloud Storage; and accessing screenshots in the bucket requires authentication, logging into a VPN or corporate network; then image previews might not work in all instant messaging and communication platforms as some services rewrite URLs to use their CDN. If this happens, we recommend using [integrations which support uploading images](#supported-contact-points) or [disabling images in notifications](#configuration) altogether.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 49,
        "lineEnd": 49,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L49-L49"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e88f3134aa96c18fed13",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "5. When uploading screenshots to a cloud storage service Grafana uses a random 20 character (30 characters for Azure Blob Storage) filename for each image. This makes URLs hard to guess but not impossible.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 51,
        "lineEnd": 51,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L51-L51"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.97a6aa58d56b61096d83",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "6. Grafana does not delete screenshots from cloud storage. We recommend configuring a retention policy with your cloud storage service to delete screenshots older than 1 month.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 53,
        "lineEnd": 53,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L53-L53"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbea95248cc159b8f404",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "7. If Grafana is configured to upload screenshots to its internal web server, and accessing Grafana requires logging into a VPN or corporate network; image previews might not work in all instant messaging and communication platforms as some services rewrite URLs to use their CDN. If this happens, we recommend using [integrations which support uploading images](#supported-contact-points) or [disabling images in notifications](#configuration) altogether.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 55,
        "lineEnd": 55,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L55-L55"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3a48695229625b18a194",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "8. Grafana does not delete screenshots uploaded to its internal web server. To delete screenshots from `static_root_path/images/attachments` after a certain amount of time, we recommend setting up a CRON job.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 57,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L57-L57"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1648af520c85d93cc139",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "9. Note you cannot adjust the number and size of images or their placement in notifications.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 59,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L59-L59"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.79fa030f79b0cfc7b120",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud users can request this feature by [opening a support ticket in the Cloud Portal](/profile/org#support).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dde51acba38595da60c0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Having set up Grafana to use the image renderer service, set `capture` in `[unified_alerting.screenshots]` to `true`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 67,
        "lineEnd": 67,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L67-L67"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb065b88ea0402a7cb95",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "# Enable screenshots in notifications. You must have either installed the Grafana image rendering # plugin, or set up Grafana to use a remote rendering service. # For more information on configuration options, refer to [rendering]. capture = false",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L69-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ffcbb6fccd7f1c2cfa10",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If screenshots should be uploaded to cloud storage then `upload_external_image_storage` should also be set to `true`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L74-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5129c46b162a5e3e0f3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "# Uploads screenshots to the local Grafana server or remote storage such as Azure, S3 and GCS. Please # see [external_image_storage] for further configuration options. If this option is false, screenshots # are persisted to disk for up to temp_data_lifetime. upload_external_image_storage = false",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 79,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L76-L79"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a155635feddfe87a61b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We recommend that `max_concurrent_screenshots` is less than or equal to `concurrent_render_request_limit`. The default value for both `max_concurrent_screenshots` and `concurrent_render_request_limit` is `5`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Advanced configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 85,
        "lineEnd": 85,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L85-L85"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fe4ed534e200bfa22dd4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "# The maximum number of screenshots that can be taken at the same time. This option is different from # concurrent_render_request_limit as max_concurrent_screenshots sets the number of concurrent screenshots # that can be taken at the same time for all firing alerts where as concurrent_render_request_limit sets # the total number of concurrent screenshots across all Grafana services. max_concurrent_screenshots = 5",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use images in notifications",
        "Advanced configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24dcd49cf3f8a6491ba915d39ffa25702ec8a226",
        "sha256": "d50961566f7efc0eb0f0055ce3b24768f06f15a4ee6ac670db804b09f527e8c7",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/images-in-notifications.md#L87-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
