      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- If uploading screenshots to a cloud storage service such as Amazon S3, Azure Blob Storage or Google Cloud Storage; and accessing screenshots in the bucket requires authentication, logging into a VPN or corporate network; image previews might not work in all instant messaging and communication platforms as some services rewrite URLs to use their CDN.",
      "headingPath": [
