    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3e8861e163b8983b2105",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In `text/template`, there is a special cursor called dot, written as `.`. You can think of this cursor as a variable whose value changes depending on where in the template it is used.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7a61e727b00769b04a469d01da199d00c5fed9e1",
        "sha256": "bda2acacaf8b0ce3dd8ce5a7cef1e180a41b2b9f7900788171f2874446b0dbfc",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b87a65670296b44a5f1f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "At the start of notification templates, dot (`.`) refers to [Notification Data](ref:reference-notificationdata).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7a61e727b00769b04a469d01da199d00c5fed9e1",
        "sha256": "bda2acacaf8b0ce3dd8ce5a7cef1e180a41b2b9f7900788171f2874446b0dbfc",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a3d81577ff7989c410f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In annotation and label templates, dot (`.`) is initialized with all alert data. It’s recommended to use the [`$labels` and `$values` variables](ref:alert-rule-template-reference-variables) instead to directly access the alert labels and query values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7a61e727b00769b04a469d01da199d00c5fed9e1",
        "sha256": "bda2acacaf8b0ce3dd8ce5a7cef1e180a41b2b9f7900788171f2874446b0dbfc",
        "lineStart": 77,
        "lineEnd": 77,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/language.md#L77-L77"
      },
      "applicability": {
