    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2aad50a746e1349e2391",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana provides a template for the notification title (`{{define \"default.title\"}}`) and a template for the notification message (`{{define \"default.message\"}}`). Both default templates display common alert details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage notification templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/template-notifications/manage-notification-templates.md",
