      "id": "grafana.candidate.08ecf892c1edb4c5d022",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Your notification template name (`{{define \"<NAME>\"}}`) must be unique. You cannot have two templates with the same name in the same notification template group or in different notification template groups. Therefore, avoid using names already defined as default templates, such as: `__subject`, `__text_values_list`, `__text_alert_list`, `default.title` and `default.message`.",
