    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.604ba7ccd1d8e0a7f607",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A label like `severity=\"critical\"` can be set statically in the alert rule configuration, or dynamically based on a query value such as the current free disk space. Dynamic labels **adjust label values at runtime**, allowing you to reuse the same alert rule across different scenarios.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic labels in alert instances"
