      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Dynamic labels lets you reuse a single alert rule across multiple escalation scenarios—but it also introduces complexity. When the label value depends on a noisy metric and changes frequently, it can lead to flapping alert instances and excessive notifications.",
