    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d8c095bc19cd85988443",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Alerting, each alert rule supports only one condition expression.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 48,
        "lineEnd": 48,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L48-L48"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b4e398e15dd00ff159b6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "That's enough in many cases—most alerts use a fixed numeric threshold like `latency > 3s` or `error_rate > 5%` to determine their state.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.afd10c133cb649f4c039",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As your alerting setup grows, you may find that different targets require different threshold values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c172e835e48351016cb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of duplicating alert rules, you can assign a **different threshold value to each target**—while keeping the same condition. This simplifies alert maintenance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fcf1cb0253ddb82fd550",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You're monitoring latency across multiple API services. Initially, you want to get alerted if the 95th percentile latency (`p95_api_latency`) exceeds 3 seconds, so your alert rule uses a single static threshold:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Example overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.005ab6f0e2a5348533ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "But the team quickly finds that some services require stricter thresholds. For example, latency for payment APIs should stay under 1.5s, while background jobs can tolerate up to 5s. The team establishes different thresholds per service:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Example overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 66,
        "lineEnd": 66,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L66-L66"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.84c40de825edb318b4bd",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `p95_api_latency{service=\"checkout-api\"}`: must stay under `1.5s`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Example overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
