    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.baeafb9e18a272c61bcc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The _Math_ expression works as long as each series in `$A` can be matched with exactly one series in `$B`. They must align in a way that produces a one-to-one match between series in `$A` and `$B`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Dynamic thresholds using a Math expression"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20c8c345dd01ae798a56aa4baa84fc630fdfd316",
        "sha256": "f4cf84d23ac5ca4d52ddec2cbaefd91d9ea845e6ea134d2bc882db37b35605e9",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e76caf11c461bfb46562",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a series in one query doesn’t match any series in the other, it’s excluded from the result and a warning message is displayed:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Dynamic thresholds using a Math expression"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/dynamic-thresholds.md",
