    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7359106914c656bed71a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Labels in both series don’t need to be identical**. If labels are a subset of the other, they can join. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Example of dynamic thresholds per dimension",
        "Dynamic thresholds using a Math expression"
      ],
