      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Prometheus**          | `prometheus_tsdb_head_series`         | Reports the number of active series currently stored in memory (the head block) of a single Prometheus instance. It includes series that have stopped receiving samples for up to one hour. |",
      "headingPath": [
