    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a1d8d94ec96e7a46a8e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of monitoring the total number of active series, you can fine-tune alerts to detect high cardinality within a specific scope — for example, by filtering on certain namespaces, services, or metrics known to generate many label combinations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Examples of high-cardinality alerts",
        "Detect high-cardinality per metric"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/examples/high-cardinality-alerts.md",
