    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.455b73841a4ad40a15fa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because the `__name__` selector queries the entire TSDB index, it’s recommended to query this using a **recording rule**:",
