    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4c7dd7e5c2e1154f8736",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Each span includes the operation name (`span_name`) and its duration (the metric value), as well as additional fields like [span status](https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/traces/#span-status) (`status_code`) and [span kind](https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/traces/#span-kind) (`span_kind`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Examples of trace-based alerts",
