    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e0e54fa2f3e6964843a3",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A server span represents work performed on the receiving side of a request, while a client span represents the outbound call (parent span) waiting for a response (client → server).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Examples of trace-based alerts",
        "Alerting on span metrics",
