    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.637789acc87cc6981577",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To detect slow inbound operations within a specific service, you can define an alert rule that detects when the percentile latency of server spans exceeds a threshold. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Examples of trace-based alerts",
        "Alerting on span metrics",
        "Detect slow span operations"
