      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The alert rules in these examples create [multi-dimensional alerts](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/best-practices/multi-dimensional-alerts/): one alert instance for each distinct span name.",
