    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f7008b06716bcaedfcff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "TraceQL can only query traces that are actually stored in Tempo. If sampling drops a large portion of traces, TraceQL-based alerts may miss real issues. Refer to [consider sampling](#consider-sampling) for guidance on how to generate span metrics before sampling.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Examples of trace-based alerts",
        "Using TraceQL"
      ],
      "source": {
