    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b79547da4a2fe038ddae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While TraceQL can be powerful for exploring and detecting issues directly from trace data, **alerting with TraceQL shouldn't be used in production environments yet**. Use it for testing and experimentation at this moment.",
