    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ce314e3cbd4fd49c241",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To reduce alert noise, Grafana Alerting [groups related firing alerts into a single notification](ref:group-alert-notifications) by default. You can customize this behavior in the alert rule or notification policy settings.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction to Grafana Alerting",
        "Fundamentals",
        "Notification grouping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/_index.md",
