      "sourceText": "| **Error<sup>\\*</sup>**   | The state of an alert when an error or timeout occurs while evaluating the alert rule after the pending period has elapsed. You can customize the behavior of the [Error state](ref:nodata-and-error-states), which by default triggers a different alert. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alert rule evaluation",
        "Alerting lifecycle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rule-evaluation/_index.md",
