    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ad84ad69ce2d361ef61",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [Labels](#labels) are used to differentiate an alert from all other alerts and decide how to manage them.",
      "headingPath": [
