    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbc44142f3cf68bdfa18",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [Annotations](#annotations) provide extra details for alert responders to help them understand and address potential issues.",
      "headingPath": [
