      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Two alert rules cannot produce alert instances with the same labels. If two alert rules have the same labels such as `foo=bar,bar=baz` and `foo=bar,bar=baz` then one of the generated alert instances is discarded.",
