      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2281965460fffcb8ac7e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Time series data** — The query returns a collection of time series, where each series must be [reduced](#reduce) to a single numeric value for evaluating the alert condition.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Data source queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 87,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L87-L87"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.279110f9f2e3c969a403",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Tabular data** — The query must return data in a table format with only one numeric column. Each row must have a value in that column, used to evaluate the alert condition. See a [tabular data example](ref:table-data-example).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Data source queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 88,
        "lineEnd": 88,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L88-L88"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9246275bbc9d36f7a4f8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The alert condition is the query or expression that determines whether the alert fires or not depending whether the value satisfies the specified comparison. There can be only one condition which determines the triggering of the alert.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Alert condition"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 96,
        "lineEnd": 96,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L96-L96"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10f19a0dcf9a2dd19f31",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the queried data meets the defined condition, Grafana fires the alert.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Alert condition"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f17e46502ab97407a7ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using **Default options**, the `When` input [reduces the query data](#reduce), and the last input defines the threshold condition.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Alert condition"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 100,
        "lineEnd": 100,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L100-L100"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c5ad912e47e22dc4a882",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using **Advanced options**, you have to choose one of your queries or expressions as the alert condition.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Alert condition"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
