      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9927faceeeb59be7582e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Expressions are only available for Grafana-managed alerts and when the **Advanced options** are enabled.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L106-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "conditional-or-paid-restriction-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3336b4fcbef1132216ca",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana, expressions allow you to perform calculations, transformations, or aggregations on queried data. They modify existing metrics through mathematical operations, functions, or logical expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f887403afa853f9a7f39",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With expression queries, you can perform tasks such as calculating the percentage change between two values, applying functions like logarithmic or trigonometric functions, aggregating data over specific time ranges or dimensions, and implementing conditional logic to handle different scenarios.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0fe79e0dc89db19e6c6b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Reduce takes one or more time series and transform each series into a single number, which can then be compared in the alert condition.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions",
        "Reduce"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L120-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a406135f6ca02d54cb9e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If queries being compared have **multiple series in their results**, series from different queries are matched(joined) if they have the same labels. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions",
        "Math"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "552ed8aeffdfa414ba93a5e202cd372a2c5004fa",
        "sha256": "5a45c7a1167e0656a3c24f733bc9219d36fcf33f18bd1e16bd1a04eb4fa85296",
        "lineStart": 128,
        "lineEnd": 128,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md#L128-L128"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b830bb1912bcbddbde01",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this case, only series with matching labels are joined, and the operation is calculated between them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions",
        "Math"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
