      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you have an alert for latency with a threshold of 1000ms and the number fluctuates around 1000 (say 980 -> 1010 -> 990 -> 1020, and so on), then each of those might trigger a notification:",
