    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e638a9347ccc50e9d347",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To prevent this, you can set a recovery threshold to define two thresholds instead of one:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Queries and conditions",
        "Advanced options: Expressions",
        "Recovery threshold"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/queries-conditions.md",
