      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Choosing how, when, and where to send your alert notifications is an important part of setting up your alerting system. These decisions have a direct impact on your team’s ability to receive the necessary information to resolve issues quickly and minimize alert noise.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
