    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.698d8f534e41d24de37a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grouping in Grafana Alerting allows you to batch relevant alerts together into a smaller number of notifications. This is particularly important if notifications are delivered to first-responders, such as engineers on-call, where receiving lots of notifications in a short period of time can be overwhelming. In some cases, it can negatively impact a first-responders ability to respond to an incident. For example, consider a large outage where many of your systems are down. In this case, grouping can be the difference between receiving 1 phone call and 100 phone calls.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 36,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L36-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.72b77bd0761109481909",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the [notification policy](ref:notification-policies), you can configure how to group multiple alerts into a single notification:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6c4a7299739e55f194be",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The `Group by` option specifies the criteria for grouping incoming alerts within the policy. The default is by alert rule.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
