    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.64cf14402ecd4a42ef08",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, notification policies in Grafana group alerts by the alert rule. Specifically, they are grouped using the `alertname` and `grafana_folder` labels, as alert rule names are not unique across folders.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications",
        "Group by alert rule or labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5af5d4efabc84ed65c54",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to group alerts by other labels, something other than the alert rule, change the `Group by` option to any other combination of labels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications",
        "Group by alert rule or labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d88dbc2accd942e5a2b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to group all alerts handled by the notification policy in a single group (without grouping notifications by alert rule or other labels), leave `Group by` empty in the Default policy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications",
        "A single group for all alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
