    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad91bc033f1fa4975550",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to receive every alert as a separate notification, you can do so by grouping by a special label called `...`, ensuring that other labels are not present.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Group notifications",
        "Disable grouping"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
