    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.93dd851ed4e856e9c8e4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the group interval timer elapses, the system resets the group interval timer and sends a notification only if there were group changes. This process repeats until there are no more alerts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Group interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 160,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L160-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.94cb5a710eae8f92a7c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the group interval timer elapses and no alerts remain, the group is deleted. The [group wait timer](#group-wait) will then start again the next time a new alert arrives.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Group interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 164,
        "lineEnd": 164,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L164-L164"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d80734b28e00c9ff7a68",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Default**: 4 hours",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Repeat interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 168,
        "lineEnd": 168,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L168-L168"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.31c195c275f7e74528fe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The repeat interval timer decides how often notifications are sent (or repeated) if the group has not changed since the last notification.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Repeat interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 172,
        "lineEnd": 172,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L172-L172"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f00ce120499e14f224e4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Repeat interval is evaluated every time the group interval resets. If the alert group has not changed and the time since the last notification was longer than the repeat interval, then a notification is sent as a reminder that the alerts are still firing.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Repeat interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 176,
        "lineEnd": 176,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L176-L176"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.24566f79a00df8cb05e7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Repeat interval must not only be greater than or equal to group interval, but also must be a multiple of Group interval. If Repeat interval is not a multiple of group interval it is coerced into one. For example, if your Group interval is 5 minutes, and your Repeat interval is 9 minutes, the Repeat interval is rounded up to the nearest multiple of 5 which is 10 minutes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Repeat interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "91b5f217315c4289957555f22cc2173c7634f54f",
        "sha256": "68fe507d70754ee668e5a1f1f372f02560e35b04feb12867e869ea0ae6022dad",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/group-alert-notifications.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b490a7ed9ca06b457b42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The maximum duration of the repeat interval is 5 days, constrained by the default value of the `notification_log_retention` setting in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Group alert notifications",
        "Timing options",
        "Repeat interval"
      ],
      "source": {
