      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using label matchers, alert instances are [routed to notification policies](#routing). The notification policy can then [group multiple alert instances into a single notification](ref:group-alert-notifications) and deliver it to the contact point.",
