      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana uses a single notification policy tree for all alert routing. There is also the option to set up and configure multiple notification policies with the [multiple policy feature](ref:multi-notification-policies), which allows you to split routing logic into separate, independently managed routing trees.",
