    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.56a19dd641a009e81358",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To determine which notification policies handle an alert instance, the system looks for matching policies starting from the top of the tree—beginning with the default notification policy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 142,
        "lineEnd": 142,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L142-L142"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2bd2056e4e4684b5ce39",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a matching policy is found, the system continues to evaluate its child policies in the order they are displayed. If a child policy matches the alert, the system then evaluates its child policies recursively until no more matching child policies are found. In this case, only the deepest matching child policy handles the alert instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 144,
        "lineEnd": 144,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L144-L144"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fea30ad3318d32908125",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, once a matching policy is found, the system does not continue to look for sibling policies. If you want sibling policies of one matching policy to handle the alert instance as well, then enable **Continue matching siblings** on the particular matching policy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 146,
        "lineEnd": 146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L146-L146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a6e6b305bb3e3a34938",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The default notification policy matches all alert instances. It always handles alert instances if there are no child policies or if none of the child policies match the alert instance's labels—this prevents any alerts from being missed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 150,
        "lineEnd": 150,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L150-L150"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.24845499532c323bb407",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If alerts use multiple labels, these labels must also be present in a notification policy to match and route notifications to a specific contact point.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.da00cbe07421997fb6c1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When an alert matches both a parent policy and a child policy (like it does in this case), the routing follows the child policy (`severity`) as it provides a more specific match.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Routing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 167,
        "lineEnd": 167,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L167-L167"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.06bf267b54b7fa13f54f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In addition to child policies being a useful concept for routing alert instances, they also inherit properties from their parent policy. This also applies to child policies of the default notification policy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Inheritance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cfdbc345e1382c0bf957df14a1e57fcf8cd9fd3",
        "sha256": "0315885a1c6c32bb66f7a60ccacbf91678b62ff054672a20e9856ff3b3bec9fc",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/fundamentals/notifications/notification-policies.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8896b2cd786b802c9e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, a child policy inherits the following notification properties from its parent:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Notification policies",
        "Inheritance"
      ],
