      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When creating an alert rule, Grafana suggests several optional annotations, such as `description`, `summary`, and `runbook_url`, which help identify and respond to alerts. You can also create custom annotations.",
