      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "It is not suitable for signals with strong recurring patterns. For example, if a signal follows daily or weekly cycles, a straight-line projection might produce values that do not reflect the signal's normal behavior.",
