    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b9910a7635a73c4aee35",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "3. The subquery `[14d:1h]` evaluates the historical data at `1`-hour intervals. This resolution is sufficient for a forecast over a long period.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting on forecasts",
        "Linear forecast with `predict_linear`",
        "Alert on a future predicted value"
