    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ffd77c55d054e312cf33",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In these cases, you can use [Grafana Machine Learning forecasting](/docs/grafana-cloud/ai-tools/dynamic-alerting/forecasting/) to generate a forecast that accounts for trends and seasonality.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting on forecasts",
        "Seasonal forecast with Grafana Cloud Machine Learning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/guides/alerting-on-forecasts.md",
