      "id": "grafana.candidate.42c17118bd65c91d7216",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There could be a number of reasons for these errors. Maybe your target went offline, or Prometheus couldn't scrape it. Or maybe your alert query failed because its target timed out or the network went down. These situations might look similar, but require different considerations in your alerting setup.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle connectivity errors in alerts"
      ],
