      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This guide walks through how to detect and handle these types of failures, whether you're writing alert rules in Prometheus, using Grafana Alerting, or combining both. It covers both availability monitoring and alert query failures, and outlines strategies to improve the reliability of your alerts.",
