    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c283ef336bf3239742d3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The alert couldn’t evaluate its query—maybe because the data source timed out or an invalid query. These are **execution errors**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle connectivity errors in alerts",
        "Understand connectivity issues in alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/guides/connectivity-errors.md",
