    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f9737a908e4dc6c7a379",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this second setup, you can run into connectivity issues on either side. If Prometheus fails to scrape the target, your alert rule might not fire, even though something is likely wrong.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle connectivity errors in alerts",
        "Understand connectivity issues in alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/guides/connectivity-errors.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ac013ad7e78eb6f989a82991e5d246600a3e436d",
        "sha256": "a3943a943a9907ac7c1b3b13ba6b8f1519bbda6b9a19cf01591f2ade20d35b63",
        "lineStart": 83,
        "lineEnd": 83,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/guides/connectivity-errors.md#L83-L83"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1c2e2ce686b1370137c5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Prometheus scrapes metrics from its targets regularly, following the [`scrape_interval`](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#scrape_config) period. The default scrape interval is 60 seconds, which is generally considered common practice.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle connectivity errors in alerts",
        "Detect target availability with the Prometheus `up` metric"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/guides/connectivity-errors.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ac013ad7e78eb6f989a82991e5d246600a3e436d",
        "sha256": "a3943a943a9907ac7c1b3b13ba6b8f1519bbda6b9a19cf01591f2ade20d35b63",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 87,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/guides/connectivity-errors.md#L87-L87"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
