    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b43aceb55458abca4e18",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Failures can slip between scrape intervals**: An outage that starts and ends between two evaluations go undetected. You could shorten the `for` duration, but this might lead to scrape failures that trigger false alarms.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle connectivity errors in alerts",
        "Detect target availability with the Prometheus `up` metric"
      ],
      "source": {
