    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0c503e3c6e78d525a176",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are a few common causes when an instance stops reporting data, similar to [connectivity errors](ref:connectivity-errors-guide):",
