    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7dac9ec58504c8c8459d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The first thing to understand is the difference between a query failure (or connectivity error), _No Data_, and a _Missing Series_.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Handle missing data in Grafana Alerting",
        "No Data vs. Missing Series"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/guides/missing-data.md",
