    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4ed1a2f0aba3c9207c22",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, imagine a recorded metric, `http_request_latency_seconds`, that reports latency per second in the regions where the application is deployed. The query returns one series per region — for instance, `region1` and `region2` — and generates only two alert instances. In this scenario, you may experience:",
      "headingPath": [
