      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This query finds regions (or other targets) that were present at any time in the past 24 hours but have not been present in the past 10 minutes. The alert rule then triggers an alert instance for each missing region. You can apply the same technique to any label or target dimension.",
