      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dcb55749768179ecfee8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Alerting provides a consolidated snapshot of your firing and pending Grafana-managed alerts in a simplified view. For users with complex deployments, it can be difficult to monitor and prioritize critical incidents among a large volume of firing or pending alerts. With the Alert page, you have a view where you can quickly explore and sort your recent alert history and see what alerts require review or action.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alert view"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/monitor-status/alerts-page.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6f9b7f46e8c67b8a680006ed36ccc098ae0ca2ff",
        "sha256": "fc057a32832c822623dfa05b42bef61b7d8f2e89d7a9adf9a74db4de79e84b97",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/monitor-status/alerts-page.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f4ba75351a798391eb83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Alerts page only shows alerts from Grafana-managed alert rules. Grafana uses a metric called `GRAFANA_ALERTS`, which is recorded in the default Mimir data source that is provisioned for cloud users.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alert view",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/monitor-status/alerts-page.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6f9b7f46e8c67b8a680006ed36ccc098ae0ca2ff",
