    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ccd8ac4785320ec8d63e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- In Grafana OSS and Enterprise, the number of alert rule versions can be limited using the [`rule_version_record_limit` option](/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#rule_version_record_limit). In Grafana Cloud, free users are allowed a maximum of 10 alert rule versions, while paid users have a maximum of 100 stored alert rule versions.",
