      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Admin users can pause or resume all of the alert rules evaluations within a folder. To pause or resume all the alert rules evaluations in a folder, click the menu icon and select **Pause all rule evaluation** or **Resume all rule evaluation**.",
