      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can then use **Grafana Explore** to query the alert state metric. For details, refer to [Alerting Meta monitoring](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/monitor/).",
