    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e5b88339197894dca236",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also configure both Loki and Prometheus to record alert state changes for your Grafana-managed alert rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure alert state history",
        "Configure Loki and Prometheus for alert state"
      ],
      "source": {
