    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6ba15803441fdb1bbeee",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Start with the same setup steps as shown in the previous [Loki](#configure-loki-for-alert-state) and [Prometheus](#configure-prometheus-for-alert-state-alerts-metric) sections. Then, adjust your Grafana configuration as follows:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure alert state history",
        "Configure Loki and Prometheus for alert state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alert-state-history/index.md",
