    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0921fb02f6acbb21ef1b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana Alertmanager**: Grafana includes a built-in Alertmanager that extends the [Prometheus Alertmanager](https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/). This is the default Alertmanager and is referred to as \"Grafana\" in the user interface. It can only handle Grafana-managed alerts.",
