    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69f5c6d17a9354d5616b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Other Alertmanagers**: Grafana Alerting also supports sending alerts to other Alertmanagers, such as the [Prometheus Alertmanager](https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Types of Alertmanagers in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dddec7320e4e8ad2f130941954110e0aa18b447a",
        "sha256": "d4b6a9d9cd932cdda982ad32f4d09586e5b039506f45dd5f3c83f99a63484206",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md#L102-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ee3544b96011eefad81e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Alerting supports using a combination of Alertmanagers and can [enable other Alertmanagers to receive Grafana-managed alerts](#enable-an-alertmanager-to-receive-grafana-managed-alerts). The decision often depends on your alerting setup and where your alerts are generated.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Types of Alertmanagers in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dddec7320e4e8ad2f130941954110e0aa18b447a",
        "sha256": "d4b6a9d9cd932cdda982ad32f4d09586e5b039506f45dd5f3c83f99a63484206",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1646d6a69718b5ce6a31",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you already have an Alertmanager running in your on-premises or cloud infrastructure to handle Prometheus alerts, you can forward Grafana-managed alerts to the same Alertmanager for unified notification handling.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Types of Alertmanagers in Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dddec7320e4e8ad2f130941954110e0aa18b447a",
        "sha256": "d4b6a9d9cd932cdda982ad32f4d09586e5b039506f45dd5f3c83f99a63484206",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md#L106-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9b2c0d019e579ccdadf6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alertmanagers should be configured as data sources using Grafana Configuration from the main Grafana navigation menu. To add an Alertmanager, complete the following steps.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Add an Alertmanager"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dddec7320e4e8ad2f130941954110e0aa18b447a",
        "sha256": "d4b6a9d9cd932cdda982ad32f4d09586e5b039506f45dd5f3c83f99a63484206",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd51794b31da68dd37b7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After adding an Alertmanager, you can use the Grafana Alerting UI to manage notification policies, contact points, silences, and other alerting resources from within Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Add an Alertmanager"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dddec7320e4e8ad2f130941954110e0aa18b447a",
        "sha256": "d4b6a9d9cd932cdda982ad32f4d09586e5b039506f45dd5f3c83f99a63484206",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8fddcc53bcf10df64e4b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using Prometheus, you can manage silences in the Grafana Alerting UI. However, other Alertmanager resources such as contact points, notification policies, and templates are read-only because the Prometheus Alertmanager HTTP API does not support updates for these resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Alertmanagers",
        "Add an Alertmanager"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/_index.md",
