      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. For the selected Alertmanager, click the **Enable/Disable** button to toggle receiving Grafana-managed alerts. When activated, the Alertmanager displays `Receiving Grafana-managed alerts`.",
