    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.668061f177fd96cbd2ab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When running multiple instances of Grafana, all alert rules are evaluated on all instances by default. You can think of the evaluation of alert rules as being duplicated by the number of running Grafana instances. This is how Grafana Alerting ensures that as long as at least one Grafana instance is working, alert rules are still evaluated and notifications for alerts are still sent.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L40-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.59b251aea30422545a41",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to reduce this duplication, you can enable [single-node evaluation mode](#single-node-evaluation-mode) so that only one instance evaluates alert rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 42,
        "lineEnd": 42,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L42-L42"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d8388051fab2f3b9fdb3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can find this duplication in state history and it is a good way to [verify your high availability setup](#verify-your-high-availability-setup).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.74ea1be284a6ab2f0c57",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While the alert generator evaluates all alert rules on all instances, the alert receiver makes a best-effort attempt to avoid duplicate notifications. The alertmanagers use a gossip protocol to share information between them to prevent sending duplicated notifications.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2f5cc349fc9806835290",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**To enable high availability support:**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb442cda868f68a1ff91",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In your custom configuration file ($WORKING_DIR/conf/custom.ini), go to the `[unified_alerting]` section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c41bde6c20eceaf832fa",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `[ha_peers]` to the number of hosts for each Grafana instance in the cluster (using a format of host:port), for example, `ha_peers=10.0.0.5:9094,10.0.0.6:9094,10.0.0.7:9094`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85910769c66b543503c8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You must have at least one (1) Grafana instance added to the `ha_peers` section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3aef6ee6650e35539b34",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `[ha_listen_address]` to the instance IP address using a format of `host:port` (or the [Pod's](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/) IP in the case of using Kubernetes).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 63,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L63-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7f2edc255a6477200435",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, it is set to listen to all interfaces (`0.0.0.0`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.98dc0689abbaf3069937",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `[ha_advertise_address]` to the instance's hostname or IP address in the format \"host:port\". Use this setting when the instance is behind NAT (Network Address Translation), such as in Docker Swarm or Kubernetes service, where external and internal addresses differ. This address helps other cluster instances communicate with it. The setting is optional.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.adf3995c0b64dc15c2e6",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `[ha_peer_timeout]` in the `[unified_alerting]` section of the custom.ini to specify the time to wait for an instance to send a notification via the Alertmanager. The default value is 15s, but it may increase if Grafana servers are located in different geographic regions or if the network latency between them is high.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Memberlist"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 66,
        "lineEnd": 66,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L66-L66"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2e1d9c86e2f0d3554863",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As an alternative to Memberlist, you can configure Redis to enable high availability. Redis standalone, Redis Cluster and Redis Sentinel modes are supported.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Enable alerting high availability using Redis"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
