      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Set `ha_redis_address` to the Redis server address or addresses Grafana should connect to. It can be a single Redis address if using Redis standalone, or a list of comma-separated addresses if using Redis Cluster or Sentinel.",
