    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5bd7eaf1f54f4a472a77",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Grafana cluster automatically chooses a primary instance that is responsible for evaluating all alert rules. Other instances skip evaluation entirely.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 181,
        "lineEnd": 181,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L181-L181"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8ca3d19d7304bf1a0ed0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Alert broadcasting:** The primary instance broadcasts fired alerts to all other instances through the cluster communication channel. This ensures that every instance's embedded Alertmanager has the current alerts, which is needed for failure recovery and for the Alertmanager API to return correct data on all instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 183,
        "lineEnd": 183,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L183-L183"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.633c2231edb143579344",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Automatic failure recovery:** When the primary instance becomes unavailable, the cluster reassigns positions and a new instance becomes responsible for evaluation. During failure recovery, there is a brief gap in evaluations. Existing alert states remain in the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 184,
        "lineEnd": 184,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L184-L184"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c4de3af6fc3b7202ed5b",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Default HA (all instances evaluate)         | Single-node evaluation mode                  |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "Tradeoffs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
