      "sourceText": "| `grafana_alertmanager_cluster_messages_publish_failures_total{msg_type=\"update\",reason=\"redis_issue\"}`     | Number of state sync messages that failed due to a Redis error.                                                                                                                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
