    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2f6b3c2423805ac1a873",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `grafana_alertmanager_cluster_messages_sent_total{msg_type=\"update\"}`                                      | Total number of state sync messages sent to Redis. Includes all HA state channels, not only alert broadcasts.                                                                                                                      |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "Monitor single-node evaluation mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 221,
        "lineEnd": 221,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L221-L221"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e411ed297888003183b8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The primary instance uses a message queue to broadcast alerts to other instances. By default, the queue holds up to 200 messages. If you have a large number of alert rules, the queue may fill up, causing messages to be dropped. You can detect this by monitoring the drop metric for your HA backend (see metrics tables above).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "Tune alert broadcast queue size"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 225,
        "lineEnd": 225,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L225-L225"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f7deca79177cc05c12b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To increase the queue size, add the following to your `[unified_alerting]` section:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "Tune alert broadcast queue size"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 227,
        "lineEnd": 227,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L227-L227"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.694c50b428d639f77f1e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The default value is `200`. This setting applies to both Memberlist and Redis HA backends.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Single-node evaluation mode",
        "Tune alert broadcast queue size"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 234,
        "lineEnd": 234,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L234-L234"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e398c1326a93561e59b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When running multiple Grafana instances, all alert rules are evaluated on every instance by default. This multiple evaluation of alert rules is visible in the [state history](ref:state-history) and provides a straightforward way to verify that your high availability configuration is working correctly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 238,
        "lineEnd": 238,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L238-L238"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b1d4bf6777c8afeafe14",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If using a mix of `execute_alerts=false` and `execute_alerts=true` on the HA nodes, since the alert state is not shared amongst the Grafana instances, the instances with `execute_alerts=false` do not show any alert status.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 242,
        "lineEnd": 242,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L242-L242"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.45e5922b87866f647ebc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The HA settings (`ha_peers`, etc.) apply only to communication between alertmanagers, synchronizing silences and attempting to avoid duplicate notifications, as described in the introduction.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 244,
        "lineEnd": 244,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L244-L244"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b913039aec6770235c87",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also confirm your high availability setup by monitoring Alertmanager metrics exposed by Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 248,
        "lineEnd": 248,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L248-L248"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c0d05ba992c6c23635fb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Starting in Grafana v12.4, these metrics are prefixed with `grafana_` (for example, `grafana_alertmanager_cluster_members`). If you are upgrading from an earlier version, update your dashboards and alert rules accordingly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 251,
        "lineEnd": 251,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L251-L251"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
