    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f3f78f4e726587362742",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can confirm the number of Grafana instances in your alerting high availability setup by querying the `grafana_alertmanager_cluster_members` and `grafana_alertmanager_peer_position` metrics.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 266,
        "lineEnd": 266,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L266-L266"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.74e057d1c2c077b005b4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that these alerting high availability metrics are exposed via the `/metrics` endpoint in Grafana, and are not automatically collected or displayed. If you have a Prometheus instance connected to Grafana, add a `scrape_config` to scrape Grafana metrics and then query these metrics in Explore.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Verify your high availability setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 268,
        "lineEnd": 268,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L268-L268"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ed49458856f6d26cfd39",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When multiple Grafana instances are running, all alert rules are evaluated on each instance by default. Each instance sends firing alerts to its respective Alertmanager. This results in notification handling being duplicated across all running Grafana instances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Prevent duplicate notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 289,
        "lineEnd": 289,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L289-L289"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19f085712b568776d3d4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alertmanagers in HA mode communicate with each other to coordinate notification delivery. However, this setup can sometimes lead to duplicated or out-of-order notifications. By design, HA prioritizes sending duplicate notifications over the risk of missing notifications.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Prevent duplicate notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 291,
        "lineEnd": 291,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L291-L291"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a03c852db28b66305df3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To avoid duplicate notifications, you can configure a shared alertmanager to manage notifications for all Grafana instances. For more information, refer to [add an external alertmanager](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/set-up/configure-alertmanager/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure high availability",
        "Prevent duplicate notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "50b1bdc40c690916a9f7083878cf20ce5baa1e93",
        "sha256": "cc5910504c15135ea6bcf731dbfa8d6e7314809567f6ce03fa07ac135c02e39b",
        "lineStart": 293,
        "lineEnd": 293,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/_index.md#L293-L293"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.56dd7c4622961513bc77",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Role-based access control (RBAC)](/docs/grafana/latest/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/) for Grafana Enterprise and Grafana Cloud provides a standardized way of granting, changing, and revoking access, so that users can view and modify Grafana resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure RBAC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "16a4c2474d17e7345751a5e76b9bc2f7e563ead3",
        "sha256": "9b5ef70a84932b42a01321650653805ee61edab5cd89c059add66d6abcdfb27e",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.996050cd4527e785b12e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A user is any individual who can log in to Grafana. Each user has a role that includes permissions. Permissions determine the tasks a user can perform in the system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure RBAC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "16a4c2474d17e7345751a5e76b9bc2f7e563ead3",
        "sha256": "9b5ef70a84932b42a01321650653805ee61edab5cd89c059add66d6abcdfb27e",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e8856f7491ca6d2a7827",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Several legacy notification permission actions have been deprecated and are no longer granted to Editor or Viewer roles. If you use custom roles or automation that rely on these actions, refer to [Deprecated permissions](#deprecated-permissions) for details and recommended replacements.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure RBAC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "16a4c2474d17e7345751a5e76b9bc2f7e563ead3",
        "sha256": "9b5ef70a84932b42a01321650653805ee61edab5cd89c059add66d6abcdfb27e",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
