      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb93b7d50b6bee2bc6cc",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Basic roles**: Admin, Editor, Viewer, and No basic role. These are assigned to users and provide default access levels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure RBAC",
        "Role types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/_index.md",
