      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These permissions apply to per-rule enrichments, configured on the **Alert enrichment** tab of an individual alert rule. Managing global enrichments from **Alerting** > **Settings** requires the **Admin** basic role and isn't granted by the `alert.enrichments` permissions or the Enrichments fixed roles.",
