      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "It is not recommended to create custom roles that include `alerting.notifications.receiver` actions with a scope other than `receivers:*`. The UID used in the scope is not stable and changes whenever a contact point is renamed.",
