    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e9ec173fc95798ab966c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Org-scoped write actions are powerful.** Granting `alert.instances:create` or `alert.instances:write` at org scope — even to a user who otherwise has only folder-level access — allows them to create or modify silences that affect the entire organization. Review all custom and inherited roles that include these actions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure silence access",
        "Security considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/silence-access/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08f12c880999f5abd21ab1f1d36598b2a9bdcbce",
        "sha256": "48ce5adc03b8e9c81a2e8976b9c694fae3d513898fd0124949cb01b507121f9d",
        "lineStart": 157,
        "lineEnd": 157,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/silence-access/index.md#L157-L157"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ac55dc5649d52f044dc",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **General silences are always visible to folder users.** You can't hide general silences from users who have any folder-scoped `alert.silences:read` permission. If general silences carry sensitive context (such as the name of an active incident), use clear, consistent naming conventions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure silence access",
        "Security considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/set-up/configure-rbac/silence-access/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08f12c880999f5abd21ab1f1d36598b2a9bdcbce",
