      "id": "grafana.candidate.cb6994161bfbe15c3455",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have configured [Prometheus for alert state history](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/set-up/configure-alert-state-history/), Grafana writes alert state changes to the `ALERTS` metric:",
      "headingPath": [
