      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [Provisioning Grafana](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning) with configuration files is not available in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use configuration files to provision alerting resources"
