      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Provisioning using configuration files takes place during the initial set up of your Grafana system, but you can re-run it at any time using the [Grafana Admin API](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/developers/http_api/admin#reload-provisioning-configurations).",
