    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e84407da42cea1e11346",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana, the entire notification policy tree is considered a single, large resource. Add new specific policies as sub-policies under the root policy. Since specific policies may depend on each other, you cannot provision subsets of the policy tree; the entire tree must be defined in a single place.",
