      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `terraform apply -auto-approve` is run as a bash command in the GitHub runner to apply the Terraform configuration files. `-auto-approve` flag is added to the command to skip interactive approval of plan before applying and make the workflow automated.",
