    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0a897cb9e0736a728251",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Commit the changes made to the `terraform.yml` in the previous step to the `main` branch in your GitHub repository. Once the changes are committed, The GitHub workflow you created should start to run automatically as the workflow we defined in the previous step runs when a pull request is created or when changes are committed to `main` branch.",
