      "id": "grafana.candidate.17271cd36316450e2a5d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `ElasticSearch`, `InfluxDB` and `AWS` folders are created in the Grafana instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage dashboards using Terraform and GitHub Actions",
        "Validation"
