      "id": "grafana.candidate.913f5abaa155a87ffa55",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `grafana_cloud_provider_aws_account`                      | Represents an AWS IAM role that authorizes Grafana Cloud to pull Amazon CloudWatch metrics for a set of regions. Usually, there's one of these resources per configured AWS account. For a full reference of this resource, refer to the [Terraform Grafana Provider reference documentation](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/cloud_provider_aws_account).                                        |",
      "headingPath": [
