      "sourceText": "This Terraform configuration configures the [Grafana provider](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs) to provide necessary authentication when interacting with the Cloud API. The [`grafana_cloud_stack` (Data Source)](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/data-sources/cloud_stack) is used to retrieve the details of your instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage Frontend Observability in Grafana Cloud with Terraform",
        "Configure a provider for Grafana Cloud"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-frontend-observability.md",
