      "sourceText": "Terraform enables you to manage [Grafana Cloud Knowledge Graph](/docs/grafana-cloud/knowledge-graph/) resources using infrastructure as code. With Terraform, you can define, version control, and deploy Knowledge Graph configurations including stack onboarding, alert rules, suppression policies, entity models, log, trace, and profile correlations, and thresholds.",
