      "id": "grafana.candidate.53a509f33fca32c62250",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, datasets are auto-configured based on detected metrics. To manually configure datasets, for example when your metrics use non-standard label names, use the `dataset` block.",
