      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Profile configurations in [Knowledge Graph](/docs/grafana-cloud/knowledge-graph/) allow you to define how continuous profiling data is queried and correlated with entities. You can specify data sources, entity matching rules, and label mappings for performance profiling.",
