    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.276c09b58ecd135ba865",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Prometheus rules in the [Knowledge Graph](/docs/grafana-cloud/knowledge-graph/) allow you to define custom recording and alerting rules that are evaluated against your metrics data. Recording rules pre-compute frequently used or computationally expensive expressions and save the results as new time series. Alerting rules define conditions that, when met, trigger alerts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage Prometheus rules using Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-knowledge-graph/prometheus-rules.md",
