    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a5dab11403608cf1491",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana IRM supports Terraform-based configuration for a limited set of resources, primarily those related to OnCall functionality. These resources use the `grafana_oncall_` naming convention in Terraform. Additional IRM components are not yet configurable via Terraform.",
