      "sourceText": "To create them, refer to [Service account tokens](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/service-accounts/#service-account-tokens). You can also refer to [Create and manage a Grafana Cloud stack using Terraform](../terraform-cloud-stack/) to set up a service account and token.",
