        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d6eb055b182ac4e85466",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also retrieve it with a `GET` request to `https://grafana.com/api/orgs/<ORG_SLUG>/instances`, where _`<ORG_SLUG>`_ is your Grafana Cloud organization name. The numeric `id` field in the response is the stack ID. This Cloud API endpoint authenticates with a [Cloud Access Policy token](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/developer-resources/api-reference/cloud-api/), which is separate from the service account token that Terraform uses.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Configure the Grafana provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L120-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.30ee54382e0fd2af4dd9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Provide each input variable through a matching environment variable that follows the Terraform `TF_VAR_<variable_name>` naming convention. The part after `TF_VAR_` is the name of the variable in your configuration: Terraform maps `TF_VAR_grafana_auth` to the `grafana_auth` variable, `TF_VAR_external_api_key` to `external_api_key`, and so on. You can also use a secrets manager or a `terraform.tfvars` file. Don't set variables in a file that you commit.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Configure the Grafana provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 127,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L124-L127"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ef6821380d39219e715",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For other authentication options, refer to the [Grafana provider documentation](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs#authentication). For end-to-end stack management, refer to [Create and manage a Grafana Cloud stack using Terraform](../terraform-cloud-stack/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Configure the Grafana provider"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 129,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L129-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.539310988728a0000869",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example stores an API key as a secure value and authorizes Synthetic Monitoring to decrypt it. Add it to `main.tf`, or to any other `.tf` file in the same working directory. Terraform loads all `.tf` files in the directory together.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 136,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L134-L136"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d6c6de95472eec7c6093",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `metadata.uid` is the secure value's _name_ in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 160,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L160-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad22ced6c2e38ef8ea65",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The resource also exposes a separate, read-only `metadata.uuid`, which is the Grafana-generated identifier rather than the name.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 161,
        "lineEnd": 161,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L161-L161"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc6c83bbeac3e73f7fc6",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `spec.description` is required and limited to 25 characters.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
