      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7b10d05561f4fdf2a583",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `spec.value` is a [write-only argument](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/resources/ephemeral#write-only-arguments) that requires Terraform 1.11 or later.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
