    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.66537a34aab42bf70705",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The full schema is on the [Terraform Registry](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/apps_secret_securevalue_v1beta1). The following tables describe the fields you use for secure values.",
