      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `manager_identity` | No       | Overrides the manager identity stamped on this resource. The default is `grafana-terraform-provider`. Useful when multiple Terraform workspaces manage resources in the same Grafana instance. |",
