    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8e5413ae9fea5ad3f467",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "At the top level, the resource exposes a read-only `id` field, which Grafana derives from the secure value's UUID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Define a secure value",
        "Schema reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
