      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.12e92d496d09f8055314",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This keeps secrets out of Terraform files. If your shell writes history, prefer a secure secret-injection flow, such as CI/CD secrets, a secret manager, or a nested shell with history disabled.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 239,
        "lineEnd": 240,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L239-L240"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.476a62e3cb6e89f7cd23",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a secure value with the same `metadata.uid` already exists in the namespace, for example from a previous apply or one created outside Terraform, the apply fails with `HTTP 409 - AlreadyExists`. To bring the existing secure value under Terraform management instead of recreating it, [import it](#import-an-existing-secure-value). To replace it on apply, set `overwrite = true` in the resource's `options` block.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 260,
        "lineEnd": 262,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L260-L262"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0c13ce832f956fe35bca",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because `spec.value` is write-only, Terraform never writes the plaintext to state. It writes only the `value_hash`. To confirm this, search your local state file for the plaintext:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform",
        "Verify that the plaintext stays out of state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 266,
        "lineEnd": 268,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L266-L268"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a9ae1b63770dcb84ad7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Replace _`<SECRET_VALUE>`_ with the plaintext secret you provisioned. The search returns no matches:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform",
        "Verify that the plaintext stays out of state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 274,
        "lineEnd": 275,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L274-L275"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dc241ab6ed0317812acc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The stored `spec` shows `value` as `null` and retains only the hash:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform",
        "Verify that the plaintext stays out of state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 281,
        "lineEnd": 281,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L281-L281"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1e999336d9e9e50d9483",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The response includes the secure value's metadata, its `spec` with `description` and `decrypters`, and the keeper that stores it. It never includes the plaintext `value`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform",
        "Verify that the plaintext stays out of state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 301,
        "lineEnd": 302,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L301-L302"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1046bb195e980b090e7f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There is no `value` field in the response. The API doesn't return decrypted secret contents.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision the secure value with Terraform",
        "Verify that the plaintext stays out of state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 327,
        "lineEnd": 327,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L327-L327"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.540a5944c4f522a7deef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The provider computes a SHA-256 hash of your configured `spec.value` at plan time and stores it in `value_hash`. When the hash changes, Terraform plans an update. When the hash doesn't change, Terraform plans no change. This lets you rotate secrets without storing plaintext in state.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 333,
        "lineEnd": 333,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L333-L333"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0c40e9cdde9c1598ec9d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the value changes, the recomputed `value_hash` drives an in-place update:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 349,
        "lineEnd": 349,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L349-L349"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.75ba9b7d5d77a721a878",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you apply again without changing the value, the hash matches and Terraform plans no change:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 359,
        "lineEnd": 359,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L359-L359"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.33b56e3cfa082c5f4e30",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Keep the following points in mind when you rotate secure values:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 367,
        "lineEnd": 367,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L367-L367"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.518e646ef24fa162d27d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **`value` is write-only.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 369,
        "lineEnd": 369,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L369-L369"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b562bc6fbf2fdd59a49b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Grafana API never returns the plaintext, and the provider never reads it back. Only `value_hash` is stored in state.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 370,
        "lineEnd": 371,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L370-L371"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ee546f755101a96eb49",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Out-of-band value changes aren't directly detectable.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 372,
        "lineEnd": 372,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L372-L372"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1d105f2b471ffa3fd66",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because the plaintext is write-only, Terraform can't read the current secret contents from Grafana. Keep Terraform as your source of truth for rotations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 373,
        "lineEnd": 374,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L373-L374"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.67666fb023351a7f83b4",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **You can't switch a secure value between `value` and `ref` after creation.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 375,
        "lineEnd": 375,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L375-L375"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0a50c1a7ae1f3c0e76cb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **`metadata.uid` is immutable.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 378,
        "lineEnd": 378,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L378-L378"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9bb2ceda65382cb38bb6",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **`decrypters` ordering is significant in Terraform.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Rotate a secure value",
        "Rotation considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 380,
        "lineEnd": 380,
