    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8b1fe76d8bb554f15279",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A _keeper_ defines where Grafana stores the encrypted material for your secure values. By default, Grafana uses the built-in system keeper, which encrypts values at rest in the Grafana database and requires no setup.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 417,
        "lineEnd": 417,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L417-L417"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.70f5e8f934299b503c6a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To store secrets in an external secret manager instead, provision a keeper with the [`grafana_apps_secret_keeper_v1beta1`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/apps_secret_keeper_v1beta1) resource. Grafana currently supports AWS Secrets Manager as a keeper.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 419,
        "lineEnd": 420,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L419-L420"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6901fef2fa1f01d064dc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana connects to AWS Secrets Manager through cross-account role assumption with AWS Security Token Service, and never stores your AWS credentials. You create an AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) role in your AWS account that Grafana can assume, and the keeper references that role.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 422,
        "lineEnd": 423,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L422-L423"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f162dd0fcc8f2cf84b1",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- An AWS account with AWS Secrets Manager enabled in your target region.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Keeper requirements"
      ],
