    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.117f391fc324bc6e09ef",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `external_id`     | Yes      | External ID that the IAM role's trust policy requires. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Keeper schema reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 500,
        "lineEnd": 500,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L500-L500"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.82852b9832b639d24663",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "At the top level, the resource exposes a read-only `active` status that's `true` when the keeper is the active keeper for the namespace.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Keeper schema reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 502,
        "lineEnd": 502,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L502-L502"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.107e37bf7d4637de50c0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set a keeper as active, use the [`grafana_apps_secret_keeper_activation_v1beta1`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/apps_secret_keeper_activation_v1beta1) resource and reference the keeper's `uid`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 508,
        "lineEnd": 508,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L508-L508"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d0db19d2851c3f7844f4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The activation resource already depends on the keeper because it references the keeper's `uid`. Any secure value that should use this keeper must depend on the activation, otherwise Terraform can create the secret while the system keeper is still active:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 518,
        "lineEnd": 519,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L518-L519"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cd127f768822a505602b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Because a namespace has only one active keeper, applying an activation for a different keeper switches which keeper is active.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 539,
        "lineEnd": 539,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L539-L539"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbbf026343eb4e5c0407",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Running `terraform destroy` on the activation resource reverts the namespace to the built-in system keeper.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 540,
        "lineEnd": 540,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L540-L540"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8d64bc696bef70004b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also set the active keeper outside Terraform, in the Grafana UI under **Administration** > **Secrets Management**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 543,
        "lineEnd": 543,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L543-L543"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aa88aa1c44c4815d0aad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After the keeper is active, Grafana routes new secure values to it automatically. A `value`-backed secure value like the one in [Define a secure value](#define-a-secure-value) needs no field changes to use the active keeper, but it still needs `depends_on` if you create it in the same configuration as the activation. Destroying a `value`-backed secure value that lives in AWS Secrets Manager deletes the AWS secret immediately, with no recovery window.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 545,
        "lineEnd": 547,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L545-L547"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5bea2370e26839dc565a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To reference a secret that already exists in AWS Secrets Manager instead of sending a new value, use `ref` in place of `value`. Set `ref` to the AWS secret name or the full ARN, not a path inside Grafana:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 549,
        "lineEnd": 550,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L549-L550"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.18adb0122628b743b6ac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Replace _`<STACK_ID>`_ with the same numeric stack ID you set on the provider. You can also set `ref` to the full secret ARN, for example `arn:aws:secretsmanager:<REGION>:<ACCOUNT_ID>:secret:grafana-secrets-manager/stacks-<STACK_ID>/db-password/1-AbCdEf`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 568,
        "lineEnd": 569,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L568-L569"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7133a2d0864c3b3ceb2b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you use `ref` while the system keeper is active, the API returns the following error:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Provision a keeper",
        "Activate and use the keeper"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52977e9c09c75dbafbdbbdb7ab05a511e921e281",
        "sha256": "408746cac5de95be048c327c72a92ce56e80f5a9bcb4614d2ab66a4dc946630b",
        "lineStart": 571,
        "lineEnd": 571,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md#L571-L571"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a12f4aaa928d814ed30c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this guide, you created a service account token, configured the Grafana provider, and provisioned a secure value with Terraform. You also learned how to rotate and import secure values, and how to provision and activate a keeper to store secrets in an external secret manager.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use Terraform to provision secure values",
        "Summary"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-secrets-management.md",
