    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fd58290f67a0f1169449",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Composable builder pattern:** You can chain different builder blocks to define dashboards fluently. You start with a `DashboardBuilder`, then add panels, queries, and other components step by step.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with the Grafana Foundation SDK",
        "Grafana Foundation SDK overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/_index.md",
