      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Configuration with structured options:** When a configuration get complex (like data reduction or display settings), the SDK uses typed option builders to keep things readable, predictable, and easy to control.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with the Grafana Foundation SDK",
        "Grafana Foundation SDK overview"
      ],
      "source": {
