    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a94b88d63f8164be66a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this video, we generate a dashboard from code and deploy it using the Grafana API, covering patterns and practices you'd use in production environments. It also includes a working example of a web service that emits metrics and logs, and shows how to deploy a dashboard alongside it using Docker Compose.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with the Grafana Foundation SDK",
