    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bc864ac5335a1067851e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Learn about [Grafana Git Sync](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync)**, which lets you synchronize your resources so you can store your dashboards as JSON files stored in GitHub and manage them as code.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with the Grafana Foundation SDK",
        "Next steps"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "60031b26f2605729a0d76dfdb96bdbea6dd4f7a0",
