    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.01958349b981f0536d83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Managing Grafana dashboards manually can be inefficient and error-prone. With the Grafana Foundation SDK you can define dashboards using strongly typed code, commit them to version control systems, and automatically deploy them using GitHub Actions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Automate dashboard provisioning with CI/CD"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/dashboard-automation.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ba2b31b4836e1f3d1153fc3fcdbdd32627f7a0b",
        "sha256": "748e6eaf826aada2d5e4c5c03a97663df42e8d1f20c3428be8755eacec9dde4f",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/dashboard-automation.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10212d74ce9583d93bef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By defending dashboards as code and managing them through CI/CD such as GitHub Actions, you will gain full version control, making it easy to track changes over time and roll back if needed. This also prevents duplication, as the workflow intelligently checks whether a dashboard exists before deciding to create or update it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Automate dashboard provisioning with CI/CD",
        "Why automate?"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/dashboard-automation.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0ba2b31b4836e1f3d1153fc3fcdbdd32627f7a0b",
        "sha256": "748e6eaf826aada2d5e4c5c03a97663df42e8d1f20c3428be8755eacec9dde4f",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/dashboard-automation.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.43f403cb5133e68bf32c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With this fully automated CI/CD pipeline, you can focus on improving your dashboards rather than manually uploading JSON files to Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Automate dashboard provisioning with CI/CD",
        "Why automate?"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/foundation-sdk/dashboard-automation.md",
