    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c09afd74ace81cc00843",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [Migrate existing dashboards](#migrate-existing-dashboards-to-git-sync): Move existing dashboards under Git Sync while **keeping their UID**, so existing links and references keep working. This option requires additional care since it adopts the resource in place and requires deleting the original resource.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
