      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The migrating option moves your existing dashboards under Git Sync while keeping their UIDs, so existing links, references, and bookmarks keep working. Because the UID is preserved, Git Sync adopts the resource in place, and you must delete the original resource so Git Sync can take over its UID.",
