    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.47be199c0117efd99304",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. [Step 3: Validate the migration](#step-3-validate-the-migration): Confirm the resources are synced before moving on.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L102-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.79c63968b2935927f518",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync only manages dashboards and folders. Alerts, data sources, library panels, and other resources are **not** supported yet, and Git Sync will not recreate them. Because migrating involves deleting resources, plan carefully before you start.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L106-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.288ef3c683d560d3dafc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync creates its own folders when it syncs with your existing repository. It derives each folder's UID from the folder's **path in the repository**, so the folders it creates are **new folders**, independent from your existing ones, even if they share the same name. As a result:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d7ae8758a400d62c61ed",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- You **don't** need to delete your original folders to migrate the dashboards inside them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8cad3c5a33cc539270a7",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Do not** delete a folder that contains alerts or library panels. Git Sync doesn't manage those, and deleting the folder deletes them permanently.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 111,
        "lineEnd": 111,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L111-L111"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.524709ab6b718f277fdf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With a folder or folderless sync, only delete the individual dashboards you're migrating, never the folders. Full-instance migrations have different cleanup behavior and can delete unmanaged folders, so follow the full-instance migration guidance instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 117,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L117-L117"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0be4e2f0fe6b9be5685c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Back up your instance first.** Export or snapshot your dashboards, folders, alert rules, and library panels before you delete anything. Deleted resources can't be restored from the Grafana UI.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9330f8d0257d63e7d10",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Migrate folder by folder.** Start with a single folder, complete the full migration for it, and validate the result before moving to the next one. This limits the impact if something goes wrong and lets you get comfortable with the process.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0b4c342254c1e7985c61",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Keep your original folders, and set them apart.** After a migration you'll have your original folder (holding any alerts and library panels) alongside the new Git Sync folder of the same name. To avoid confusion, rename your original folders or move them under a single top-level **Alerts & Library Panels** folder. This keeps the unsupported resources intact and clearly separated from the provisioned dashboards. If you instead need links to your original folders to keep working, refer to [Preserve links to the original folders](#preserve-links-to-the-original-folders).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2bd23c280ef2643c8876",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Export the dashboards you want to migrate so that each file keeps the dashboard's original UID (`metadata.name`), then commit the files to your Git repository. You can use either of the following:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Step 1: Export the resources to your repository"
      ],
      "source": {
