    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.768a05c4e0f602cd41c1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can export existing dashboards from the terminal or from agentic coding tools using the CLI `gcx`. With `gcx` you can download the resources you want to sync from Grafana, and then commit and push those files to your provisioned Git repository. Git Sync will then detect the commit, and synchronize with Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Step 1: Export the resources to your repository",
        "Export with the Grafana CLI"
      ],
      "source": {
