    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ae69c27bffdef0b41b9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Trigger a new pull to complete the sync. The dashboards are recreated as provisioned, with their original UIDs, so existing links keep working.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Step 3: Validate the migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
