    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf56c08c4474f7ff00f5",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Confirm each dashboard appears in the provisioned folder and opens correctly. It may take a few minutes for changes to appear; if they don't, refresh the UI manually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Step 3: Validate the migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 214,
        "lineEnd": 214,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L214-L214"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f3e884188a54b30caeb",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Confirm that the alert rules and library panels in your original folders are still present and working.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Step 3: Validate the migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 215,
        "lineEnd": 215,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L215-L215"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3dffd44b6d88e24a3df8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Git Sync gives each synced folder a new UID derived from its path in the repository. This means links and URLs that point to your original folders keep pointing to the original folders, not the new provisioned ones.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 221,
        "lineEnd": 221,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L221-L221"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2ad003ae6efa8a2b4c83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need existing folder links and URLs to resolve to the provisioned folders instead, you can pin a folder's UID with a folder metadata file so Git Sync reuses the original folder's UID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 223,
        "lineEnd": 223,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L223-L223"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f519c34c25bf131515f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Folder metadata requires the `provisioningFolderMetadata` feature, which is enabled by default. If your administrator has disabled it, `metadata.name` is ignored and folders always get a path-derived UID.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 227,
        "lineEnd": 227,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L227-L227"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.deea3af8ce633d7f27bb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To reuse an original folder's UID, add a `_folder.json` file to that folder's directory in the repository:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 231,
        "lineEnd": 231,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L231-L231"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a0039957ccc7203f9a8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Where `<ORIGINAL_FOLDER_UID>` is the UID of your existing folder. You can find it in the folder's URL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 242,
        "lineEnd": 242,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L242-L242"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b9dab5b01f1b48327ce1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because this option reuses the original folder's UID, the synced folder collides with your existing unmanaged folder, and Git Sync can't take over a UID that still belongs to an unmanaged folder, with the sync failing with a conflict. To avoid losing unsupported resources, complete these steps for each folder **before** you sync:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 244,
        "lineEnd": 244,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L244-L244"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aee0d273c830895b1504",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Create a new folder and move all alert rules, library panels, and other unsupported resources out of the original folder into it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
        "lineStart": 246,
        "lineEnd": 246,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md#L246-L246"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.73c5d2fcd37d674fe601",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Delete the original folder. Its dashboards should already be exported to the repository from [Step 1](#step-1-export-the-resources-to-your-repository).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add non-provisioned resources from Grafana",
        "Migrate existing dashboards to Git Sync",
        "Preserve links to the original folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "24b5a04c2b83a41ec4c569ead44762c37221e868",
        "sha256": "f1058883a394fd101f6673570b6b0da5ebb692aaf7f090e501ad6a9d76d39208",
