      "id": "grafana.candidate.342177b22c9837319c6d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Reapply any custom permissions on the new provisioned folder — folder permissions don't carry over. Refer to [Git Sync permissions and access control](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana).",
      "headingPath": [
