      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alternatively, on-prem file provisioning in Grafana lets you include resources, including folders and dashboard JSON files, that are stored in a local file system. Refer to [Provision resources on-prem](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/) for more details.",
