    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2650ec987f2c22ec66d0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [Create a new fine-grained personal access token](https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new). You need a Personal Access Token from an **Admin** role to set up the repository. GitHub only grants the **Webhooks: Read and write** permission to repository admins, so tokens created by non-admin users can't manage the webhooks Git Sync relies on for instantaneous updates and pull request previews.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
