      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Next, sync the external resources you specified in the previous step with your Grafana instance. You can store these provisioned resources in Grafana, either at the root of the provisioned folder or in a new folder, without affecting the rest of your instance.",
