      "sourceText": "1. You may see the experimental checkbox **Migrate existing resources**, which allows you to migrate your unmanaged dashboards to the provisioned folder. If you don't, refer to [Export non-provisioned resources from Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources/) to learn how to migrate your existing resources.",
