    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b72e3fdd6ea88a751fb3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After deciding on these options, you can chose to configure **Webhooks** or a verified account with the **Commit options**. Alternatively, if you want your your commits to remain unsigned, click **Save** to continue.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Optional settings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 242,
        "lineEnd": 242,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L242-L242"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a3d03360466c36513b72",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the **Webhook options** menu, you can type in an URL to override the auto-detected URL used to register webhooks. Make sure you have the appropriate permissions to set up and manage webhooks.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Webhook options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 246,
        "lineEnd": 246,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L246-L246"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a1f1ab4a4e9b77e068aa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also check the **Disable webhook integration**. When checked, Grafana doesn't register or receive webhook events, and polls the repository on an interval instead. Use this when your Grafana instance is not reachable from the public internet.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Webhook options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 248,
        "lineEnd": 248,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L248-L248"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4fcffc78c6c607a7dfb4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git providers limit the amount of webhooks they allow in their repositories. Refer to [Webhook limits](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-extend#webhook-limits) for more information and to learn how to proceed if you reach these limits.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Webhook options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 250,
        "lineEnd": 250,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L250-L250"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.042e14ea3e30c3cb0249",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Starting in Grafana 13.1.0, you can **configure a verified account** with a signing key, allowing you to enforce your users to sign commits so your Git provider can mark them as _Verified_. Git Sync supports GPG, SSH, and S/MIME keys.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Signed commit options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 254,
        "lineEnd": 254,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L254-L254"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5427b16412f8dad3c49f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Starting in Grafana 13.2.0, by default all commits use the signed-in Grafana user as the commit author. For more details, refer to [Authoring options](#authoring-options).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Signed commit options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "33d133fedbf7d5b75cc61bf56a8502e90588ed73",
        "sha256": "f2062c974b81baf5c08c993990a364b77bbfde702588c73573454013a1db7117",
        "lineStart": 256,
        "lineEnd": 256,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/_index.md#L256-L256"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.86ef089e814e41054ce9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For the moment, Git Sync doesn't support:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Git Sync",
        "Choose additional settings",
        "Signed commit options"
