    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eab65c86f2da2205a07d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync doesn't route over AWS PrivateLink or Private Data Source Connect (PDC). Instead, Git Sync uses the normal public path from the Hosted Grafana IPs, which is independent from PrivateLink and PDC. AWS PrivateLink and PDC provide a separate tunnel for data source query traffic, from Grafana to your private databases or data sources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Network connectivity and IP allowlisting",
        "AWS PrivateLink and Private Data Source Connect"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d05b163dbceab2f43f4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**If you use AWS PrivateLink or PDC for data sources, you can still use Git Sync**. The two features neither interfere with nor depend on each other.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Network connectivity and IP allowlisting",
        "AWS PrivateLink and Private Data Source Connect"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2e8e84e9ec1cefa8b3c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This setting is available for Grafana v13.0.4 and Grafana v13.1.1 and later. It only applies to self-managed Grafana (OSS and Enterprise), but it's not configurable in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.81287d43c5c27e30983e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While public Git servers such as `github.com`, `gitlab.com`, and `bitbucket.org` resolve to public addresses and are always allowed, by default Git Sync rejects repository URLs with a host that resolves to a loopback, a private (RFC 1918), link-local, or an unspecified address. This protects your Grafana instance against server-side request forgery (SSRF).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 79,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L79-L79"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.261555a898a5d3fb47fb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you connect Git Sync to a Git server on a private network such as a self-hosted GitHub Enterprise, GitLab, or Bitbucket instance reachable only through an internal address, add its host to the `allowed_git_urls` allowlist:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 81,
        "lineEnd": 81,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L81-L81"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1d4ceff55a248805e3b",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Open your Grafana configuration file, either `grafana.ini` or `custom.ini`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 83,
        "lineEnd": 83,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L83-L83"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c2b5dbb4a93995ce394e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Add each internal Git host to `allowed_git_urls` as a comma-separated list:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 84,
        "lineEnd": 84,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L84-L84"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ab01c50f488f329b9a5c",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Save the changes to the file and restart Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 91,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L91-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e0aa906272a539ebd9d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each entry can be a hostname, `host:port`, a full URL (only the host is used), a literal IP address, or a CIDR range. If possible, use specific hosts or narrow ranges, since a broad CIDR such as `10.0.0.0/8` re-exposes the entire private range that SSRF protection blocks.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f2c99338d087622042bf345c086471391da07834",
        "sha256": "5d2acd510bdbd42862c2d45954358ef9e0b7a76029e68156869e6d7f7b6d4071",
        "lineStart": 93,
        "lineEnd": 93,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md#L93-L93"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0441519362ec7de07f72",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Only add hosts you trust** because an allowlisted host receives the configured Git token on every sync, fetch, and push.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Allow internal or private Git servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-before.md",
