      "sourceText": "GitHub Apps are tools that extend GitHub functionality. They use fine-grained permissions and short-lived tokens, giving you more control over which repositories are being accessed. Find out more in the [GitHub Apps official documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/apps/overview).",
