    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b60481da68541ef7b714",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After [setup](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/), you can optionally extend Git Sync by enabling pull request notifications and image previews of dashboard changes.",
