    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a56b8305ce4e1c450660",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- GitHub limits each repository to 20 webhooks per event type, such `push` and `pull_request`. For more information refer to the official [GitHub webhooks documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/webhooks/types-of-webhooks).",
