    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9cdcb11897d43f7f1106",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to point `[server] root_url` to an internal address (for example, when Grafana runs behind a private ingress in a Kubernetes cluster), set the publicly-reachable URL with `[provisioning] public_root_url` instead. This URL is used both to register webhook callbacks with the Git provider and as the base for screenshot images embedded in pull-request comments, which the Git provider's servers fetch from the public internet.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up instantaneous pulling and dashboard previews in Pull Requests",
        "Set up webhooks for real-time notification and pull request integration",
        "Set a publicly-reachable URL"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-extend.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e5e1646dc0b7673cc79293c5422fedd13ce3ef40",
        "sha256": "df0fba5b4d839219ea059f937de98ae001ed0736781da68a4f1ab690a8fca2bb",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-extend.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0c7e72a2290d3fcfcb1e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The per-repository `spec.webhook.baseUrl` field still overrides `public_root_url` for webhook registration, and screenshot URLs always use `public_root_url` (or `root_url` when unset).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up instantaneous pulling and dashboard previews in Pull Requests",
        "Set up webhooks for real-time notification and pull request integration",
        "Set a publicly-reachable URL"
      ],
      "source": {
