      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set up image rendering to add visual previews of dashboard updates directly in pull requests, **install the Grafana Image Renderer** in your Grafana instance. For more information and installation instructions, refer to the [Image Renderer service](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer).",
