    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1063f4d51c122f84eca",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following examples use the same repository to show how the same files appear with each mode.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync key concepts",
        "How does Git Sync behave?",
        "Sync targets"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/key-concepts.md",
