    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.46e71298e92bd1684f66",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `_folder.json` file stores the `team-platform` folder's stable UID and display name, so the folder keeps its identity and permissions if you move or rename it in the repository. Refer to [The Git Sync folder metadata file](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync/#the-git-sync-folder-metadata-file) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync key concepts",
        "How does Git Sync behave?",
        "Sync targets"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/key-concepts.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "42567b5161bf94b42a306fa4fdb130a74696e7d1",
