      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you use Git Sync, your dashboard configurations are stored as code in a Git repository. You can configure Git repository protection to control who can access this source code and who can modify it. Repository protection works as an additional security layer after Grafana internal permissions.",
