    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b2890dba8ea53684a38e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Private repositories**: Only authorized users can view repository contents. This protects dashboard configurations, queries, and any embedded credentials or sensitive data from public access.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control access to your Git repository",
        "Read access (repository visibility)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 94,
        "lineEnd": 94,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L94-L94"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.74e88f638584d30ff0cb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For Git Sync to function, the authentication credentials configured in Grafana must have read access to pull dashboard changes from Git to Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control access to your Git repository",
        "Read access (repository visibility)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 96,
        "lineEnd": 96,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L96-L96"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4bea96f117bc0edf4d18",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Write access controls who can push changes to your repository. This determines who can modify dashboard source code, either directly or through pull requests.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control access to your Git repository",
        "Write access (push permissions)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 100,
        "lineEnd": 100,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L100-L100"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2fabca4cc70ab4b1d1b8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Direct write access**: Users with write permission can push commits directly to branches. For Git Sync to push dashboard changes from Grafana to Git, the authentication credentials must have write access to the repository.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control access to your Git repository",
        "Write access (push permissions)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L102-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2e2940bac898dc02cc8a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Protected branches**: Branch protection rules can restrict direct writes and require changes to go through pull requests with review and approval, even for users with write access.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control access to your Git repository",
        "Write access (push permissions)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6d6073737b54bc7961f5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync supports different modes for writing dashboard changes to your repository, from allowing direct commits to requiring formal review processes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4f0d7c8854f3196c2bc8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configure the repository as read-only in Grafana to prevent any writes to Git from the Grafana UI. Dashboards sync from Git to Grafana, but users cannot save changes back to Git.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Read-only mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 114,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L114-L114"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.166fe58c79234973e7ac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Use when**: Git is the single source of truth and all changes must be made through direct Git commits or CI/CD processes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Read-only mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb48b1f87053d6ab87c2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the repository allows writes and branch protection is not enabled, Git Sync commits dashboard changes directly to the configured branch without review.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Direct commit mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 120,
        "lineEnd": 120,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L120-L120"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbd4562337d46a023cea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Use when**: Rapid iteration is needed and changes don't require formal review, such as in development environments.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Direct commit mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L122-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.868063c9ffd9e56e1461",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When branch protection is enabled at your Git provider, Git Sync prompts you to go create pull requests in your Git repository instead of committing directly. Changes require review and approval before merging to the main branch.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Pull request mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
        "sha256": "50a57ccc1f7a228094557ff2e708ebf915ba9d64b8496c1ff986f26d8109f9cc",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6da6ce08e81d5be4c685",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Use when**: Changes require review and approval, such as in production environments or when multiple teams collaborate on dashboards.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Git repository protection",
        "Control how changes are written in Git Sync",
        "Pull request mode"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-git.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6a903989a5695897ddb934d6c664049d3dde0231",
