      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Organization-level:** Default permissions of the `Admin`, `Editor`, or `Viewer` role. Refer to [Roles and permissions](ref:roles-and-permissions) for more details.",
      "headingPath": [
