      "id": "grafana.candidate.b12dfe56f9daf44f3f3d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These roles grant Grafana permissions (`dashboards:read`, `dashboards:write`, `folders:create`...) that are checked when users interact with provisioned resources through the Git Sync files endpoint. Dashboards within a provisioned folder inherit the folder's permissions.",
