    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.915fe88fcca6c0c79ab2",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Create the folders first.** A folder must exist in Grafana—and have a `_folder.json` file with a stable UID—before you can assign permissions to it. Let Git Sync create and sync the folders, then apply the permissions that reference the resulting UIDs. If you try to set a permission for a folder that hasn't been synced yet, there's no UID to attach it to.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 167,
        "lineEnd": 167,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L167-L167"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9723362d880ba75a049",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Permissions don't sync to Git.** You set them per Grafana instance. Every instance that syncs the same repository shares the same folder UIDs (from `_folder.json`), so you can apply the same permission definitions to each instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 168,
        "lineEnd": 168,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L168-L168"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c8926c596d5e04d1b06",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To safely modify permissions, each provisioned folder must include a `_folder.json` metadata file with the folder's UID. Without this file, the folder's UID is derived from its repository path, so folder permissions can be lost if the folder is moved to a different path in the Git repository.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 171,
        "lineEnd": 171,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L171-L171"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6ad7b9a45a006d96ad3c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For folders created from the Grafana UI, the metadata file is added automatically. If your folder is missing the metadata file, the UI shows a warning with instructions on how to add it. Refer to [The Git Sync folder metadata file](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync/#the-git-sync-folder-metadata-file) for details about this file and why it exists.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 173,
        "lineEnd": 173,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L173-L173"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b9e9c25dc92c336d11b0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set folder permissions manually or as code. In both cases, apply them only after Git Sync has created the folders.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 176,
        "lineEnd": 176,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L176-L176"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.36ac67ccae16c5650030",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana UI**: Navigate to the folder and select **Folder actions > Manage permissions**. Add or edit permissions for roles, teams, or users.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions",
        "Set permissions manually"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 180,
        "lineEnd": 180,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L180-L180"
      },
      "applicability": {
