      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8205941cc8733fa73f49",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **RBAC (Enterprise/Cloud)**: Use [Role-Based Access Control](ref:rbac) for fine-grained permission management.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions",
        "Set permissions manually"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 182,
        "lineEnd": 182,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L182-L182"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.95d1f37d4147abeb532c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can manage folder permissions as code with the [Grafana Terraform provider](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs). Because Git Sync—not Terraform—creates the folders, reference each folder by the UID from its `_folder.json` file (the `metadata.name` value). Apply the permissions only after Git Sync has synced the folders, so the folder UIDs already exist.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions",
        "Set permissions with Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 186,
        "lineEnd": 186,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L186-L186"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.57d7ef331b810cea1e19",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use [`grafana_folder_permission_item`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/folder_permission_item) to manage a single permission entry. This is additive, so it only manages the entries you declare and leaves other permissions untouched:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions",
        "Set permissions with Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 188,
        "lineEnd": 188,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L188-L188"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.891641836533eea7010b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alternatively, use [`grafana_folder_permission`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/folder_permission) to declare the full set of permissions for a folder in a single resource. This resource is authoritative: any permission that isn't listed is removed when you apply the configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure folder and dashboard permissions",
        "Modify folder-level permissions",
        "Set permissions with Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 209,
        "lineEnd": 209,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L209-L209"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.75f7ca165f01a34eb914",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're a Grafana Enterprise or Grafana Cloud user with RBAC enabled, Git Sync provides fine-grained permissions that allow more granular control over Git Sync operations. You can create custom roles that combine Git Sync permissions in different ways. Refer to [Role-Based Access Control](ref:rbac) documentation for instructions on creating and managing custom roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure fine-grained access control (RBAC)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 217,
        "lineEnd": 217,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L217-L217"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53954a8fa3f77be1e457",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Understanding which permissions each basic role receives helps you create custom roles or understand exactly what access users have. The tables below show which Git Sync permissions are granted to each role by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure fine-grained access control (RBAC)",
        "How basic roles map to RBAC permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 221,
        "lineEnd": 221,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L221-L221"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19ea0f9073b8576bc1f8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `provisioning.settings:read` permission is granted to all roles (Viewer and above) and allows viewing Git Sync system settings, which is necessary for the UI to display properly. This does not grant access to modify settings or manage repositories.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure fine-grained access control (RBAC)",
        "How basic roles map to RBAC permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e444f862ef773a88367ad776e7e19e307efa213a",
        "sha256": "2e5c6a369da225e2cfee8cba6d470b69133247b10f19f12d58c91c6683f26870",
        "lineStart": 224,
        "lineEnd": 224,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana.md#L224-L224"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d7bbba158e7f5ba7f2b1",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Permission Category      | Specific Permissions                                                                                                                              | What This Allows                                                                                                                        |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Git Sync permissions and access control",
        "Configure fine-grained access control (RBAC)",
        "How basic roles map to RBAC permissions",
        "Admin role"
      ],
      "source": {
