      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can document the contents or any other relevant piece of information of your provisioned folder in a `README.md` file stored alongside its resources in the repository. Grafana renders the README inline on the folder page, below the list of dashboards, so your team can see what's in the folder, how it's organized, and where to find the right dashboard without leaving Grafana.",
