      "sourceText": "Grafana renders [Mermaid](https://mermaid.js.org/) diagrams defined in your Markdown documents. Use them to embed architectural diagrams, incident runbook flows, or data pipeline overviews next to the dashboards that monitor them. Use a fenced code block with the `mermaid` language to include a diagram:",
