      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0431e5b3c8c09bb2c549",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Fast iteration**: You want the low-friction editing of a non-provisioned instance, but with the safety of Git history.",
