    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f1098e62e1a849420943",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you enable only the `write` workflow, saving a dashboard always commits directly to the sandbox branch. To also allow users to open pull requests from Grafana, add the `branch` workflow: `workflows: [write, branch]`. Refer to [Configuration parameters](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/git-sync-setup/set-up-code/#configuration-parameters) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Configuration parameters"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 115,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L115-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f4f8a24affb7ed01f97",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Create a sandbox branch in your repository, for example `sandbox`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6914715b2ad0822814f1",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. Configure a Repository resource that syncs that branch with the `write` workflow enabled.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L122-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.38d1db4d3c83e02c8a60",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "3. Users create and edit dashboards in Grafana, optionally in their own subfolder. Each save commits directly to the sandbox branch.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c3c7425fdd8f04c3e768",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "4. The experience feels similar to using Grafana without Git Sync, but every change is committed to Git.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.38a32d0c6abd0e9680d9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "5. When work is ready, you promote it to the `main` branch. Refer to [Promote a sandbox to main](#promote-a-sandbox-to-main).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.806eab895346d7a00e45",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A sandbox can be shared by everyone or scoped to a single user. Each sandbox is a branch synced through its own Repository connection, so the choice is shaped by the per-stack limit of 10 repository connections. Refer to [Usage and performance limitations](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits/) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Individual or shared sandboxes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 129,
        "lineEnd": 129,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L129-L129"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.65f35ed61ebdaf5bbfab",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Shared sandbox (recommended)**: Use a single branch, such as `sandbox`, synced through one Repository connection that all users share. This uses only one connection regardless of how many users work in it, so it scales to any number of users. Separate users' work with subfolders (for example, `alice/`, `bob/`) if you want some organization within the shared branch. The trade-off is less isolation, since everyone commits to the same branch. This is the setup described above.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Individual or shared sandboxes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 131,
        "lineEnd": 131,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L131-L131"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.91dd7bd319e1d1e9c16d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Individual sandboxes**: Give each user their own branch, such as `sandbox/alice` and `sandbox/bob`, each synced through a separate Repository connection. This provides the most isolation, but every sandbox consumes one of your 10 connections, so per-user sandboxes don't scale to many users. Reserve them for a small number of active users or short-lived projects, and delete the branch and its connection when the work is done to free the connection.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Individual or shared sandboxes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3b0e0126cbe495967d21",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Even though sandbox branches allow direct pushes, protect them against destructive operations. We recommend blocking force pushes on sandbox branches in your Git provider.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 138,
        "lineEnd": 138,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L138-L138"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.25cadc30ca673fa75eac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Force pushes rewrite branch history and can silently discard commits that Git Sync relies on. Blocking them keeps history append-only, so Grafana and Git stay consistent and you can always trace how a dashboard reached its current state.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 140,
        "lineEnd": 140,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L140-L140"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.48a620b3a071f713024d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **GitHub**: Add a branch protection rule (or ruleset) for the sandbox branch (for example, `sandbox` or the pattern `sandbox/*` if you use individual sandboxes) and disable **Allow force pushes**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 142,
        "lineEnd": 142,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L142-L142"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2a6f74ab0bcf595c823f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **GitLab**: Set the sandbox branches as protected and disallow force push.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 143,
        "lineEnd": 143,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L143-L143"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.358608d60b6fabdbd559",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Bitbucket**: Add a branch permission for the sandbox branch that prevents rewriting history.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 144,
        "lineEnd": 144,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L144-L144"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a40d12062e179cb005a0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You typically keep pull requests optional on sandbox branches so users can push directly, while still blocking force pushes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Protect sandbox branches"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 146,
        "lineEnd": 146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L146-L146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7a19217cebdd0e616ab8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When sandbox work is ready, promote it to the `main` branch. Because everything already lives in Git, promotion is a standard Git operation. Choose the option that fits your review requirements:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 150,
        "lineEnd": 150,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L150-L150"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e0830038102e5f0edfaf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use your Git provider to open a pull request from the sandbox branch into `main`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main",
        "Option 1: Open a pull request from the sandbox branch (recommended)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
        "sha256": "54a70c21506a3344e822c1438cb3767384a14cf4fac3e250aa75aab4d11c67cc",
        "lineStart": 154,
        "lineEnd": 154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md#L154-L154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6131cd0e55053a14c275",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In your Git provider, open a pull request from `sandbox` into `main`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main",
        "Option 1: Open a pull request from the sandbox branch (recommended)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
