    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d6558ef063eab23fb0c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When `main` is synced to a production instance, treat the sandbox as the development stage of a promotion flow.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main",
        "Option 3: Promote through a separate instance or path"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ab0b5a5c579a3ec986a716a3d624f56b3e79cf67",
