      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69405d1b722d5c4a7a57",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Save a copy**: Open the sandbox dashboard, select **Save as** (save a copy), and choose the folder backed by the `main` branch as the destination. Git Sync commits the copy to `main`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main",
        "Option 4: Promote from the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
