      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.134dd3214da882fa3b76",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Import dashboard**: Export the dashboard from the sandbox (**Export** as JSON), then use **Dashboards > New > Import** and save it into the folder backed by the `main` branch. Git Sync commits it to `main`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Testing sandboxes with Git Sync",
        "Promote a sandbox to main",
        "Option 4: Promote from the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/scenarios/testing-sandboxes.md",
