      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.07824ebaddfd544bfa2f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On Grafana Cloud, tier limits can't be changed from configuration. Contact Support if you need a higher connection limit, or [shard by capacity](#shard-by-capacity-not-by-team) instead of using a single connection per team or microservice.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 51,
        "lineEnd": 51,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L51-L51"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8acf584720afe7f72de",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On self-managed Grafana (OSS or Enterprise), the repository count of **10** in the table is the **default**, not a hard ceiling. Raise or remove it with `[provisioning] max_repositories` in the Grafana configuration file. On-prem resources per repository stay unlimited by default (`max_resources_per_repository = 0`), and you can set a cap if you want one.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 53,
        "lineEnd": 53,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L53-L53"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f166785361c0d8b6d2d7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On Grafana Cloud, the repository-connection limit is a per-stack limit. On self-managed Grafana, the effective limit is whatever you set for `max_repositories` (default `10`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Recommended limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.81ec2c7515a8474ed788",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Both of these limits are early figures. As Git Sync matures, these limits will raise by orders of magnitude. The goal is for Git Sync to support around 100 repository connections per stack, and up to roughly 1,000 in the longer term, with similar increases to the number of resources you can sync per connection.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Recommended limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5f6e89e6081936f2f2d1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If these limits are affecting your use of Git Sync, [get in touch](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/developer-resources/contribute/#communicate-with-grafana) and explain your situation. You may also share any ideas or suggestions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Recommended limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 67,
        "lineEnd": 67,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L67-L67"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.757412e3f2d080462af0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before changing your usage limits, study your specific use case. Design the repository structure carefully, and determine how many repositories and how many resources you can support. For example, setting over 1,000 resources per repository may impact your system's performance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.65bc3f4aef10797d5068",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On Grafana Cloud, limits are enforced per tier and can't be edited from configuration. The 10-connection limit can be increased slightly on request, but splitting a single repository across multiple connections is the recommended way to sync more resources without changing tier limits.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana Cloud"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 79,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L79-L79"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ],
        "restriction": "Usage and performance limitations > Usage tiers and limits > Modify your usage limits > Grafana Cloud"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea39453f3758b3bca2ef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Limit increases aren't granted automatically. When you request one, Support will ask you to describe your use case to understand why the current limits aren't enough, and assess whether the increase is necessary and safe for your stack's performance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana Cloud"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 81,
        "lineEnd": 81,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L81-L81"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ],
        "restriction": "Usage and performance limitations > Usage tiers and limits > Modify your usage limits > Grafana Cloud"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aaaae59d92fafb8b26d9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana On-prem (OSS or Enterprise), the table value of **10** repositories is only the default, not a hard ceiling. Resources per repository remain unlimited by default. The 1,000-resources-per-connection figure is a performance recommendation, not an on-prem default cap.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana OSS/Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 85,
        "lineEnd": 85,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L85-L85"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.401523eec42c234aecfa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're an on-prem user you can change the limits directly through configuration settings, as described below.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana OSS/Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 87,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L87-L87"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e98afb0edc2e87e1df8f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To customize the limits use one of these configuration settings:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana OSS/Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 89,
        "lineEnd": 89,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L89-L89"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d33067c1aece9f3e67e9",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Use `max_repositories` to set how many repositories you can sync. Default is `10`. Set to `0` for unlimited repositories. Refer to [`max_repositories`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#max_repositories) in the Configure Grafana section to learn more.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana OSS/Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 91,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L91-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.203db37bb88e37bb94dd",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Use `max_resources_per_repository` to set the amount of resources per repository to sync. Default is `0` (unlimited). Refer to [`max_resources_per_repository`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#max_resources_per_repository) in the Configure Grafana section to learn more.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Modify your usage limits",
        "Grafana OSS/Enterprise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.409a494db561f2611e48",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a single repository holds more than 1,000 resources, you don't have to raise the per-repository limit. Instead, connect the same repository multiple times, with each connection pointing to a different folder (path) in the repository. Each connection syncs its own subset of resources and counts toward the 1,000-resource recommendation independently.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 96,
        "lineEnd": 96,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L96-L96"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c1775d2e1c7f8ad705a4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because a stack allows up to 10 repository connections, this lets you sync up to roughly 10,000 resources from a single repository while keeping each connection within the recommended range.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 98,
        "lineEnd": 98,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L98-L98"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c044b2ec86b8248c4400",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you split a single repository across several connections, use [folderless sync](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/key-concepts#sync-targets) for each connection. With folder sync (the default), every connection creates its own wrapper folder named after the repository, so splitting the repository would change your folder hierarchy and nest resources one level deeper. Folderless sync places each connection's resources at the top level, so the split has no effect on how your dashboards and folders are organized in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 100,
        "lineEnd": 100,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L100-L100"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.45aa3be3e729f42a59fb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need more than that, the 10-connection limit can be increased slightly for Cloud stacks on request. Contact Support to discuss your use case.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L102-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1342e0c3b0cc1f7cb079",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On Grafana Cloud, syncing this many resources may also exceed your stack's maximum number of dashboards. If it does, you'll need to increase that limit as well. Refer to [Dashboard and folder limits](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/cost-management-and-billing/manage-invoices/understand-your-invoice/usage-limits/#other-usage-limits) to review and adjust your dashboard limits.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cef99626714d5a9a2e05",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you have many teams or tenants, it's tempting to create one connection per team so each team maps to its own connection. Avoid this: it consumes connections quickly, doesn't scale as teams grow, and on Grafana Cloud a single stack can't be granted the hundreds of connections this would require.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository",
        "Shard by capacity, not by team"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2615965e0283c22800cb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead, shard by capacity. Create one repository and group teams into a small number of shard folders, each holding up to about 1,000 resources, and connect each shard folder separately. For example, a customer with 190 teams and 900 resources fits comfortably in a single shard today:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository",
        "Shard by capacity, not by team"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.537361b924e173edf8da",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As the number of resources grows, add `shard-2`, `shard-3`, and later shards, and connect each one. You can move teams between shards at any time to balance the load, so you only pay for the connections you actually need and can grow up to the 10-connection limit without restructuring your repository.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository",
        "Shard by capacity, not by team"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.55f44cc5c221daf73f59",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If sharding isn't practical for your setup, try raising the per-connection resource limit modestly, for example from 1,000 to a limit in the 1,200 - 1,500 range. This is a small adjustment for a bit of extra headroom, not an order-of-magnitude increase. Still, do not go beyond 1,500 resources per connection because of the performance impact on Grafana. For substantially larger scales, sharding remains the recommended approach.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Usage tiers and limits",
        "Scale beyond 1,000 resources per repository",
        "Shard by capacity, not by team"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.236450d0a0a49db45432",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync works across multiple organizations for self-managed Grafana instances. You can set up Git Sync independently in each of your organizations, and what you sync in one organization does not affect another. Teams that share a single Grafana instance across separate organizations can each manage their own provisioning from Git.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Git Sync across multiple organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 129,
        "lineEnd": 129,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L129-L129"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
