    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a389825852e08b8b1970",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync supports up to four nested folders within a repository.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Resource support and compatibility",
        "Nested folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 190,
        "lineEnd": 190,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L190-L190"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.14cc2664c46be36e2656",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When migrating to resources to Git Sync, you can still create, edit or delete resources, but changes may not be exported. The duration of this process depends on the number of resources involved.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Known limitations",
        "Migration to Git Sync"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 198,
        "lineEnd": 198,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L198-L198"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f2d2c6235e72dfe994b7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To add existing resources as provisioned Git Sync resources, you can use the Import dashboards tool, save them from the UI, save them as JSON files and commit them to the synced repository, or use `gcx`. Refer to [Export non-provisioned resources from Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources) for more details. When migrating existing dashboards, the folder structure will be replicated in the provisioned repository.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Known limitations",
        "Use existing resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 202,
        "lineEnd": 202,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L202-L202"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.67499fd42cc0bd7e0724",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync cannot take ownership of a resource while an unmanaged resource with the same UID exists in Grafana, so you may need to manually remove the original resources to ensure the transition to provisioned resources. Since deleting resources implies certain operational caveats, refer to [How to delete existing resources in Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/export-resources#how-to-delete-existing-resources-in-grafana) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Known limitations",
        "Use existing resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 206,
        "lineEnd": 206,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L206-L206"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d647159df03649acf2aa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Restoring resources from the UI is currently not possible. As an alternative, you can restore dashboards directly in your GitHub repository by raising a PR, and they will be updated in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Usage and performance limitations",
        "Known limitations",
        "Restore resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "259bfe6ffcef787e176c67fcf3b490f8ca9e966e",
        "sha256": "0cc8f7958ef6206b1f6ae32efdb03081375fab9f7c98f50e4b61847ff95c95ac",
        "lineStart": 212,
        "lineEnd": 212,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/usage-limits.md#L212-L212"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8ed6cc053bd960a73552",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Git Sync functionalities are constantly evolving. [Contact Grafana](https://grafana.com/help/) for support or to report any issues you encounter and help us improve this feature.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync"
      ],
