      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e4cfde893a5afb18ef7c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- As code with Terraform, using the folder UID from `_folder.json`. Refer to [Modify folder-level permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/permissions-grafana/#modify-folder-level-permissions) for manual and Terraform examples.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "Modify folder permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8d06cc9339a384d33e81204a50e24fc585e5f61d",
        "sha256": "f80c982f721ef3b85587eca12c6e547bad8659ff5609fc020a26f14461ee2368",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dc6e845ad782e054e4ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each provisioned folder in a synced repository contains a `_folder.json` metadata file at its root. This file is the folder's manifest: it stores the folder's stable UID and its display name, so both survive changes to the repository layout.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "The Git Sync folder metadata file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8d06cc9339a384d33e81204a50e24fc585e5f61d",
        "sha256": "f80c982f721ef3b85587eca12c6e547bad8659ff5609fc020a26f14461ee2368",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.70e49daebe3d4fa79239",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The file exists because a directory path isn't a stable identity. Without `_folder.json`, Grafana derives the folder UID from a hash of the directory path in the repository. If you move or rename that directory in Git, the hash changes and Grafana treats it as a different folder: everything attached to the old UID, such as custom folder permissions, bookmarks, and API references, is lost. With `_folder.json`, the UID travels with the directory, so you can reorganize your repository without breaking permissions or references.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "The Git Sync folder metadata file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8d06cc9339a384d33e81204a50e24fc585e5f61d",
        "sha256": "f80c982f721ef3b85587eca12c6e547bad8659ff5609fc020a26f14461ee2368",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9abb1813dc1f574b33e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The file also separates the folder's display name from the directory name. The directory keeps a filesystem-friendly name, for example `team-platform`, while the `spec.title` field holds the name shown in the Grafana UI, for example `Team Platform`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "The Git Sync folder metadata file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8d06cc9339a384d33e81204a50e24fc585e5f61d",
        "sha256": "f80c982f721ef3b85587eca12c6e547bad8659ff5609fc020a26f14461ee2368",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 134,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md#L134-L134"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd7d39d1573262babb3b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- When you create a provisioned folder from the Grafana UI, Git Sync commits the `_folder.json` file together with the folder.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "The Git Sync folder metadata file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
