    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.90265eb4b28bf092bc72",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- If a folder is missing the file, for example because you created the directory directly in Git, Grafana falls back to the hash-derived UID and shows a warning in the UI with instructions on how to add the missing metadata.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Work with provisioned repositories in Git Sync",
        "Manage folder permissions",
        "The Git Sync folder metadata file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/use-git-sync.md",
