      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To migrate from `grafanactl` to `gcx`, search-and-replace `grafanactl` with `gcx`. For `grafanactl resources serve`, use `gcx dev serve` instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Install and set up the `grafanactl` CLI"
      ],
      "source": {
