    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f0f05a61b317b59b699a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On-prem file provisioning is available in Grafana v12 and later for open source and Enterprise editions. It's **not available in Grafana Cloud**. This new file provisioning feature is only available for dashboards and doesn't replace classic provisioning for the time being.",
      "headingPath": [
        "On-prem file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cfbd59bfc467a4ac42b645e91ad33686a4b2e081",
        "sha256": "39427173b6b8aa0017dda51da73d6960549ac2de91d126cd55842a7798b10fa1",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "conditional-or-paid-restriction-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc4e950337454eb8808a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On-prem local file provisioning allows you to add resources that are stored in your local file system to your Grafana instance. You can configure how to save your dashboards' JSON and other files from your local file system into a single or multiple folders in a different repository, with up to 10 connections.",
      "headingPath": [
        "On-prem file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cfbd59bfc467a4ac42b645e91ad33686a4b2e081",
        "sha256": "39427173b6b8aa0017dda51da73d6960549ac2de91d126cd55842a7798b10fa1",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md#L29-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cb21b3e1072cf8919856",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set it up [using the UI](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup#set-up-file-provisioning-using-the-ui) or [as code](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup#set-up-file-provisioning-as-code) with the Grafana CLI. Refer to [Set up file provisioning](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "On-prem file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cfbd59bfc467a4ac42b645e91ad33686a4b2e081",
        "sha256": "39427173b6b8aa0017dda51da73d6960549ac2de91d126cd55842a7798b10fa1",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2be4d0bbe41eb97df83d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "File provisioning uses the same `Repository` resource as Git Sync, with the repository `type` set to `local`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "On-prem file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cfbd59bfc467a4ac42b645e91ad33686a4b2e081",
