    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4c2501de8e7a7b293764",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On-prem file provisioning is available in Grafana v12 and later for open source and Enterprise editions. It's **not available in Grafana Cloud**. This new file provisioning feature is only available for dashboards and doesn't replace classic provisioning for the time being.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "conditional-or-paid-restriction-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cceea612fa5afeb4ba64",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use local file provisioning to include in your Grafana instance resources that you store in your local file system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 29,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L29-L29"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.59984b65bef8149c145a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The local path mount is referred to as a `repository`. File provisioning uses the same `Repository` resource as [Git Sync](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/git-sync/), with the repository `type` set to `local` and a `path` that points to a directory on the Grafana server's file system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L31-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0ce061e698b6c183c6aa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using the local path lets you also use it with a tool like `fuse`, allowing you to mount S3 buckets as local paths. You can also use tools like `restic` to automatically back up your dashboards to your preferred backup storage solution.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 33,
        "lineEnd": 33,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L33-L33"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.60ba5357af5cb56610b0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set up file provisioning in two ways:",
