    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a6a80d67b4d940303859",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- [As code](#set-up-file-provisioning-as-code) with `gcx`, the Grafana CLI, so you can manage the configuration in a GitOps-style workflow.",
      "headingPath": [
