    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4cdefc51161ef1651a97",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Both approaches require you to first [configure the permitted paths](#configure-permitted-paths) in the Grafana configuration file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 40,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L40-L40"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2d856e27d8190c61adac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The UI refers to this feature as _file provisioning_ and to the storage location as _local storage_. In the `Repository` resource, the corresponding repository `type` value is `local` and the path is set in `spec.local.path`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5db8f3b2143af29f3a4c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For production systems, use the `folderFromFilesStructure` capability instead of **Administration** > **Provisioning** to include dashboards from a local file system in your Grafana instance. Refer to [Provision Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning/#provision-folders-structure-from-filesystem-to-grafana) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "New file provisioning capabilities"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
