    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6cc23f3485fe5a4157cb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- To set up file provisioning as code, you also need `gcx` configured with your Grafana instance details. Refer to the [Grafana CLI documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/observability-as-code/grafana-cli/) for setup instructions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.78671d4ee8b3c555519a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `provisioning` feature toggle is enabled by default in Grafana Cloud and, starting in Grafana v13, for OSS and Enterprise as well. No manual configuration of the feature toggle is required.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Configure permitted paths"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.89ac85e63ccfa35cc7e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The local setting must be a relative path and its relative path must be configured in the `permitted_provisioned_paths` configuration option. The configuration option is relative to your working directory, i.e. where you are running Grafana from; this is usually `/usr/share/grafana` or similar.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Configure permitted paths"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L70-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5e9feb56f8d41464e953",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Local file paths can point to any directory that is permitted by the configuration. The default paths is `devenv/dev-dashboards` and `conf/provisioning` in your `grafana` installation directory.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Configure permitted paths"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L73-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bdd8099222348f6fff83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The path must behave as a standard file directory on the system of choice. Any subdirectories are automatically included.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Configure permitted paths"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 77,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L76-L77"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.888681df514620828aab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The values that you enter for the `permitted_provisioning_paths` become the base paths for those entered when you enter a local path in the **Connect to local storage** wizard or in the `spec.local.path` field of a `Repository` resource.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Configure permitted paths"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
