    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b869d2b1a31f72cd9994",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The local path can point to any directory that is permitted by the configuration. Refer to [Configure permitted paths](#configure-permitted-paths) for information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Set up file provisioning using the UI",
        "Connect to local storage"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52411b91a10086b58c64d1283ca8312174e568c7",
        "sha256": "24d61f85f4057851ac0f8d7482542c908d53127b0b7c80e5ca89165034b4cca6",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md#L104-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a3e91da49629c2aa6ffb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The starting path is always your working `grafana` directory. The prefix that must be entered is determined by the locations configured in `permitted_provisioning_paths`. The default paths are `devenv/dev-dashboards` and `conf/provisioning` in your `grafana` installation directory. The value you enter in the Grafana UI must _begin_ with any of the configured values. For example, `conf/provisioning/test` is valid, but `conf/test` is not.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up file provisioning",
        "Set up file provisioning using the UI",
        "Connect to local storage"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/as-code/observability-as-code/provision-resources/file-path-setup.md",
