    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6e4890c7243e24b9449e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you wish, you can make any files synchronized as as **Read only** so no changes can be made to the resources through Grafana. Any resources made outside of Grafana and saved to the local repository will be reflected in Grafana.",
