    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f1d915da446d09625686",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For release highlights and deprecations, refer to our [v10.0 What’s new](../../whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0/). For the specific steps we recommend when you upgrade to v10.0, check out our [Upgrade guide](../../upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/).",
