    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c113d04d73ee4f41ab6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You create a new Grafana Cloud stack and intend to use any panel or data source plugins written using the Angular.js JavaScript framework. See the [list of Angular plugins](../../developers/angular_deprecation/angular-plugins/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "General breaking changes",
        "Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks",
        "You are affected if:"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f55c473a793866712b72c992a0f3e962e71e945b",
        "sha256": "7182bdb5b678e1c91768a46bd37de4cdc244c5408956243298447536324002de",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0 > General breaking changes > Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks > You are affected if:"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a6d66603e74c0c91baed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "AngularJS is an old frontend framework that stopped active development many years ago. Because of that, it's a security risk. AngularJS also requires **unsafe-eval** in the [CSP (Content Security Policy)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en/Security/CSP) settings, which also reduces the security level of how javascript is executed in the browser.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "General breaking changes",
        "Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks",
        "Background"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f55c473a793866712b72c992a0f3e962e71e945b",
        "sha256": "7182bdb5b678e1c91768a46bd37de4cdc244c5408956243298447536324002de",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0 > General breaking changes > Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks > Background"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ca9cd5f2e5dd107d8fb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Angular plugin support in Grafana is deprecated, meaning it will be removed in a future release. There are still some community and private plugins built using Angular. Starting with v9.0, Grafana has a server configuration option, called [angular_support_enabled](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#angular_support_enabled), that controls whether Angular plugin support is available.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "General breaking changes",
        "Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks",
        "Background"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f55c473a793866712b72c992a0f3e962e71e945b",
        "sha256": "7182bdb5b678e1c91768a46bd37de4cdc244c5408956243298447536324002de",
        "lineStart": 56,
        "lineEnd": 56,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md#L56-L56"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0 > General breaking changes > Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks > Background"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7f92bf4e1c0cef3de180",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Angular is disabled by default for all new Grafana Cloud stacks. Existing stacks in Grafana Cloud, Grafana Enterprise on-premise instances, and Grafana OSS instances will not be automatically impacted.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "General breaking changes",
        "Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks",
        "Change in Grafana v10"
      ],
      "source": {
