    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e45feec07294de944cc3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using Angular plugins in Grafana, try an alternative panel or data source that doesn't use Angular. This list of detected [Angular plugins](../../developers/angular_deprecation/angular-plugins/) offers alternatives where they exist.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "General breaking changes",
        "Angular is deprecated and turned off by default for new Grafana Cloud stacks",
        "How to mitigate"
      ],
      "source": {
