    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f2b147d7ac927b6774c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana has been upgraded to React 18 and now leverages the new React client rendering API. Plugin authors in particular should be aware, as there could be unintended side effects due to the changes around automatic batching of state updates and consistent `useEffect` timings.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "For Plugin Developers",
        "Upgrading to React 18",
        "Description"
