    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7e47949f0c653214f7e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Working with DataFrames was more complicated than it should have been because data was held in a Vector interface rather than a simple Array. In Grafana v10, the interface has been changed so developers can use simple arrays or Vectors.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "For Plugin Developers",
        "DataFrame: Use Array<T> or Vector<T> for field values",
        "Description"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f55c473a793866712b72c992a0f3e962e71e945b",
        "sha256": "7182bdb5b678e1c91768a46bd37de4cdc244c5408956243298447536324002de",
        "lineStart": 318,
        "lineEnd": 318,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md#L318-L318"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.38068293730e7615746b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Any code using Vectors will continue to work without issue. If you've implemented your own version of Vector, it will need to be updated. The easiest approach is to refactor code so it extends MutableVector. This will work in both Grafana v9 and v10.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "For Plugin Developers",
        "DataFrame: Use Array<T> or Vector<T> for field values",
        "Migration path"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v10-0.md",
