    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a22143016ff0dee5c4aa",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **More flexible:** With @grafana/create-plugin, you have more control over your plugins and their dependencies, and can more easily customize the tooling to fit your specific needs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "For Plugin Developers",
        "grafana/toolkit CLI commands have been removed and migrated to the create-plugin package",
        "Description"
      ],
