      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b2ef71d1fd8257afb091",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Faster development time:** With its out-of-the-box development environment @grafana/create-plugin can significantly reduce development time compared to using @grafana/toolkit.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v10.0",
        "For Plugin Developers",
