      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are using the Grafana provider for Terraform to manage data source permissions, you will need to upgrade your provider to [version 2.6.0](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/2.6.0/docs) or newer to ensure that data source permission provisioning keeps working. Issue [#5880](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-enterprise/pull/5880).",
