    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6ee91c2ca1ab593e85f1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For data sources that extend `DataSourceWithBackend`, the filterQuery method is now called before the data source query method. If the `filterQuery` method assumes that some kind of query migration happens before this method is called, you now need to do the migration inside this method too.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Users and Operators",
        "Data sources: Query filtering changes",
        "Migration/mitigation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 160,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L160-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.28db5f12accb1cca3a6e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you set Google OAuth configuration using `api_url,` you might be using the legacy implementation of OAuth, which doesn't have the HD parameter describing the organization from which the approved token comes. This could break your login flow.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Users and Operators",
        "Chore: Query oauth info from a new instance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 170,
        "lineEnd": 170,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L170-L170"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ce1fdcb435ba6c1c4d50",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can turn off this feature through the configuration toggle `validate_hd `. Anyone using the legacy Google OAuth configuration should turn off this validation if the ID Token response doesn't have the HD parameter.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Users and Operators",
        "Chore: Query oauth info from a new instance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 172,
        "lineEnd": 172,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L172-L172"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.015e93e820262f8289e8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With the introduction of the Scenes library to dashboards, the URL that’s generated when viewing an individual repeated panel has changed. We’ve changed how these panels are referenced and what used to be `&viewPanel=panel-5` is now `&viewPanel=panel-3-clone1`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Users and Operators",
        "Changes to how the panel view URL is generated for repeated panels",
        "Description"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 180,
        "lineEnd": 180,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L180-L180"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8e1c6255c779ec6b920",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana v11 we're marking react-router v5 as deprecated. App plugins should start migrating to use react-router v6.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Plugin developers",
        "React Router is deprecated",
        "Description"
      ],
