    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c69aee88c0bfdc42715",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We recommend all plugin authors to migrate their end-to-end tests to use the new Playwright-based [grafana/plugin-e2e](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@grafana/plugin-e2e?activeTab=readme) package instead. Find details on how to migrate from grafana/e2e to grafana/plugin-e2e in the [migration guide](https://grafana.com/developers/plugin-tools/e2e-test-a-plugin/migrate-from-grafana-e2e).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Plugin developers",
        "The grafana/e2e testing tool is deprecated",
        "Migration/mitigation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 214,
        "lineEnd": 214,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L214-L214"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.77449ba106e366afd877",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Vector interface that was deprecated in Grafana v10 is further deprecated. Using it now generates build-time Typescript errors, but it remains working at runtime. If you're still using ArrayVector in your code, you should remove it immediately and replace it with plain arrays. Plugins that are compiled against older versions and depend on calling get/set will continue to work because the Array prototype still has a modified prototype. This will be removed in the future.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Plugin developers",
        "Chore: Taint ArrayVector with `never` to further discourage"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 220,
        "lineEnd": 220,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L220-L220"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.05774236424cecd589d9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We've removed React 17 as a peer dependency from our packages. Anyone using the new versions of these packages should ensure they've upgraded to React 18 following [the upgrade steps](https://react.dev/blog/2022/03/08/react-18-upgrade-guide).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Plugin developers",
        "Chore: Remove React 17 peer deps"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e65c171b56655c00d5db715c33a93107531034dd",
        "sha256": "be805a73df9178f03227fa8d4cc7ef7fe36a689d21d16d5018ddbb637fc85dc0",
        "lineStart": 226,
        "lineEnd": 226,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md#L226-L226"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2779a83893d655a750fc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "SystemJS is no longer exported from `@grafana/runtime`. Plugin developers should instead rely on importing modules/packages using standard TS import syntax and npm/yarn for package installation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Breaking changes in Grafana v11.0",
        "Plugin developers",
        "Chore: Remove SystemJS from Grafana/Runtime"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/breaking-changes/breaking-changes-v11-0.md",
