      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud includes pre-configured data sources for Prometheus, Loki, and Tempo, so you can start querying without additional setup. Refer to [Grafana Cloud documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/) for details.",
