      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, any user in an organization can query any data source in that organization. With [Grafana Enterprise](ref:grafana-enterprise) or Grafana Cloud, you can configure **data source permissions** to restrict query, edit, and admin access to specific users, teams, or roles. Refer to the [data source management documentation](ref:data-source-management) for details.",
