      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can define and manage data sources as code using the Grafana provisioning system. This lets you configure data sources through YAML files or Terraform instead of the Grafana UI, which is useful for automated deployments and version-controlled configuration.",
