      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using the Prometheus implementation, you can manage silences in the Grafana Alerting UI. Contact points, notification policies, and templates are read-only because the Prometheus Alertmanager API does not support write operations for these resources.",
