    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b063625b456d3e1cfed0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Amazon CloudWatch data source supports [Grafana Alerting](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/). You can create alert rules on CloudWatch metrics and CloudWatch Logs, so Grafana notifies you when a metric crosses a threshold or when a log query returns a value that meets your alert condition.",
