    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ffbb454843a2d87da438",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you match by metric, **Region**, **Namespace**, **Metric name**, and **Statistic** are all required. If any of them are missing, the query returns an `invalid annotations query` error. Dimensions are optional, but adding them narrows the results to alarms on a specific resource.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Amazon CloudWatch annotations",
        "Create an annotation query",
        "Match alarms by metric"
      ],
      "source": {
