      "sourceText": "Grafana data source plugins make requests to AWS on behalf of an AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) [role](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html) or IAM [user](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_users.html). The IAM user or IAM role must have the associated policies to perform certain API actions for querying data source data. Since these policies are specific to each data source, refer to individual data source plugin documentation for details.",
