    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc1ec6d9de2909011318",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `AWS SDK Default` uses the [default provider](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-go/v1/developer-guide/configuring-sdk.html) from the [AWS SDK for Go](https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go) without custom configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure AWS authentication",
        "Select an authentication method"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/aws-authentication/index.md",
