      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Proxy Configuration** settings appear only when per-data source HTTP proxy support is enabled with the `per_datasource_http_proxy_enabled` option in the Grafana configuration file. They let each CloudWatch data source use its own outbound HTTP proxy for AWS requests.",
