    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a61f58d115c6ae344873",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| **Proxy Type**     | Select how the proxy is configured: `Environment (default)` uses the `HTTP_PROXY` and `HTTPS_PROXY` environment variables, `None` disables the proxy, and `URL` lets you specify a proxy URL. Don't set this when Secure Socks Proxy is enabled. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Amazon CloudWatch data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI"
      ],
      "source": {
