      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To read CloudWatch metrics and EC2 tags, instances, regions, and alarms, you must grant Grafana permissions via IAM. You can attach these permissions to the IAM role or IAM user you configured in [AWS authentication](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/aws-authentication/).",
