      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Grafana [configuration file](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#aws) includes an `AWS` section where you can configure data source options:",
      "headingPath": [
