      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.580903131d6cfdbfb86f",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `list_metrics_page_limit`           | Sets the limit of List Metrics API pages. When a custom namespace is specified in the query editor, the [List Metrics API](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/APIReference/API_ListMetrics.html) populates the _Metrics_ field and _Dimension_ fields. The API is paginated and returns up to 500 results per page, and the data source also limits the number of pages to 500 by default. This setting customizes that limit. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Amazon CloudWatch data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI",
        "Configure the data source with grafana.ini"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/configure/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "55de406ecf9d9059613bbf9035604a180127e1c5",
        "sha256": "503d730eec9d66ae219c4ba63e6a3284727b034befb2f41af9502edd47cea32e",
        "lineStart": 355,
        "lineEnd": 355,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/configure/index.md#L355-L355"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c16124d6933ea12282c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can define and configure the data source in YAML files as part of the Grafana provisioning system. For more information about provisioning and available configuration options, refer to [Provision Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/provisioning/#data-sources).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure the Amazon CloudWatch data source",
        "Configure the data source in the UI",
        "Provision the data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/configure/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "55de406ecf9d9059613bbf9035604a180127e1c5",
        "sha256": "503d730eec9d66ae219c4ba63e6a3284727b034befb2f41af9502edd47cea32e",
        "lineStart": 359,
        "lineEnd": 360,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/configure/index.md#L359-L360"
