      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5f2ee870e5045adb20d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Click **Select log groups** to choose the target log groups for your query. When the **Monitoring account** badge appears in the query editor header, you can search and select log groups across multiple accounts. Use the **Accounts** filter to narrow results by account. For large lists, use prefix search to narrow the selection. The selector loads log groups in pages, so you can scroll to load more results when many log groups are available.",
