      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you use **Logs Insights QL**, **OpenSearch PPL**, or **OpenSearch SQL**, you must specify a region and define the logs to query by selecting log groups, selecting CloudWatch Logs data sources, or choosing a supported log group query scope.",
