    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e64127f25fce8e25bbbc",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Alert on log error rates:** Build a Logs query that returns numeric data with the `stats` command, then create an alert rule on the result. Refer to [Create queries for alerting](#create-queries-for-alerting).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Amazon CloudWatch query editor",
        "Common use cases"
      ],
