    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a0339208b74818c2c1ca",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Incorrect access key or secret key               | Verify the credentials in the AWS Console under **IAM** > **Users** > your user > **Security credentials**. Generate new credentials if necessary.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Amazon CloudWatch data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "\"Access Denied\" or \"Not authorized to perform this operation\""
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/troubleshooting/index.md",
