    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4b4b00634fbd5f498e09",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| The connection test only validates the assume-role step | When you configure an **Assume Role ARN**, **Save & test** confirms that the primary credentials can perform `sts:AssumeRole`. It doesn't verify that the assumed role has CloudWatch or Logs permissions. Attach the required query permissions to the assumed role, not only to the primary credentials.                             |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Amazon CloudWatch data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "\"Save & test\" passes but queries return no data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/troubleshooting/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "beaeae2cfe415b08e86f250d421cb38d035fbede",
