    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1c306cce0091314f2f1f",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Temporary credentials expired and weren't refreshed | Methods that use temporary credentials, such as Assume Role or STS, issue short-lived tokens. If the data source uses static temporary credentials, switch to an authentication method that refreshes automatically, such as Assume Role with long-lived base credentials or an EKS/EC2 instance role. Refer to [AWS authentication](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/aws-authentication/). |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Amazon CloudWatch data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Data source stops working after about an hour"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/troubleshooting/index.md",
