    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.76e46f2665e91bb06c0c",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| A VPC endpoint policy restricts which actions are allowed          | Update the policy on the CloudWatch, Logs, EC2, or STS VPC endpoints to allow the required actions, such as `cloudwatch:ListMetrics` and `cloudwatch:GetMetricData`.                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Amazon CloudWatch data source issues",
        "Authentication errors",
        "Access blocked by a VPC endpoint policy or service control policy"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/troubleshooting/index.md",
