    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1c9e944392eba1e40d10",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Azure Monitor data source supports [Grafana Alerting](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/) and [Grafana-managed recording rules](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules/), allowing you to create alert rules based on Azure metrics, logs, traces, and resource data. You can monitor your Azure environment and receive notifications when specific conditions are met.",
