      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Increase the data source timeout.** The default timeout is 30 seconds, but Azure Log Analytics queries can take up to 3 minutes. Open the Azure Monitor data source settings, scroll to **Misc**, and set **Timeout** to `300`. Refer to [Query timeout](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/azure-monitor/configure/#query-timeout).",
