      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Toggle **Enable Basic Logs** to allow queries against [Basic Logs tables](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/logs/basic-logs-query?tabs=portal-1) in supported Log Analytics Workspaces.",
