      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because requests to the Batch API are sent to the `metrics.monitor.azure.com` data plane endpoint, you need the [Monitoring Reader](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/essentials/rest-api-walkthrough#retrieve-metric-values-multi-dimensional-api) role at the subscription scope to use it.",
