      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "New queries default to Builder mode. Existing queries that were created with raw KQL remain in Code mode. When you switch to Builder mode, the time-range setting automatically changes to **Dashboard** because the builder manages time filtering for you.",
