      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To remove this limit, enable the `azureMonitorDisableLogLimit` [feature toggle](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/feature-toggles/) in your Grafana configuration.",
