    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.107d09a80f57e1077c02",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also select additional number value columns, with or without multiple dimensions. For example, this query returns a count and average value by hour, Computer, CounterName, and InstanceName:",
