    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d854b9b1e58b5c26846a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Increase the data source timeout.** Open the Azure Monitor data source settings, scroll to the **Misc** section, and increase the **Timeout** to `300` (seconds). Refer to [Query timeout](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/azure-monitor/configure/#query-timeout) for details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Azure Monitor data source issues",
        "Query errors",
        "Logs query timeout"
      ],
      "source": {
