      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Cause:** When a Logs query uses the **Logs** result format, Grafana truncates the results to 30,000 rows to prevent the browser tab from crashing, because the logs visualization renders every row at once.",
