      "id": "grafana.candidate.5298ce65e5e07c01c1c1",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Increase the data source timeout.** The default is 30 seconds, but Azure Log Analytics queries can take up to 3 minutes. Open the Azure Monitor data source settings, scroll to **Misc**, and set **Timeout** to `300`. Refer to [Query timeout](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/azure-monitor/configure/#query-timeout).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot Azure Monitor data source issues",
        "Alerting errors",
        "Alert evaluation timeout"
      ],
