      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Data sources, plugins, and integrations work together to build observability solutions. The following diagram shows two paths: the custom path where you install plugins and configure data sources yourself, and the integration path where Grafana Cloud provides a pre-packaged setup.",
