      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Grafana maintenance policy for the Elasticsearch data source aligns with [Elastic Product End of Life Dates](https://www.elastic.co/support/eol). Grafana ensures proper functionality for supported versions only. If you use an EOL version of Elasticsearch, you can still run queries, but the query builder displays a warning. Grafana doesn't guarantee functionality or provide fixes for EOL versions.",
